{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017LKsSNXADiPDaXJtyAMGQW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Framing B 完全成立：Paper = systematic mining study + methodological\n2\t  contribution。\n3\t\n4\t  Standard eval 上 embed Δ 较小（Qwen ~+0.4pp, StarCoder ~+0.6pp），但 D062 query-split  evaluation\n5\t  揭示标准评估因 checkpoint 过拟合掩盖了真实效应——held-out evaluation 上 embed Δ  恢复至 Qwen +1.4pp, StarCoder\n6\t  +0.9pp（均在 best 档预设范围内）。这一发现本身就是方法论贡献： checkpoint selection criterion effect (+16.3pp\n7\t  max) > mining strategy effect (~1pp)， 说明社区低估了 mining 效果是因为评估方法论缺陷。\n8\t\n9\t  BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm（Δ ≤ -1.5pp），empirically 关闭 CoCoHaNeRe 修正论证。 UniXcoder\n10\t  3-seed null result 干净地归因于 125M scale boundary condition。 RepoBench-R 替代 SWE-bench\n11\t  作为 held-out external validation，CIs non-overlapping。\n12\t\n13\t  3 claims 原样成立：Claim 1 (embed mining reliable) + Claim 2 (exploratory representation  geometry\n14\t  interaction) + 额外贡献 (checkpoint criterion methodology)。EMNLP Main 强投。\n15\t\n16\t  M2 anchors — Standard eval: Qwen random=0.570, embed=0.573, SC random=0.479, embed=0.485。\n17\t  D062 query-split: Qwen random=0.361, embed=0.375, SC random=0.305, embed=0.314。\n18\t\n19\t  '\n20\timagined_experiments:\n21\t- name: M3a SWE-bench Lite E2E — OOD Limitation Disclosure\n22\t  plan_id: plan_003\n23\t  description: '3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint on SWE-bench Lite 300 instances。\n24\t    实际已完成（random_s42, 100 instances + BM25 baseline 300）。结果为 OOD 泛化失败， 在论文中作为 limitation\n25\t    呈现而非贡献。\n26\t\n27\t    '\n28\t  expected_results:\n29\t    random_s42_100:\n30\t      R_at_1: 0.04\n31\t      R_at_5: 0.11\n32\t      R_at_10: 0.14\n33\t      R_at_20: 0.16\n34\t      MRR: 0.0698\n35\t    bm25_baseline_300:\n36\t      R_at_1: 0.2733\n37\t      R_at_5: 0.4667\n38\t      R_at_10: 0.55\n39\t    neural_vs_bm25_gap_R1_pp: -23.3\n40\t    status: DONE_FAILED\n41\t    director_decision: 放弃 SWE-bench 作为论文贡献，外部验证改用 RepoBench-R\n42\t  result_rationale: 'R@1=0.04 vs BM25=0.2733 表明 contrastive retriever 在 OOD 跨 repo\n43\t    场景完全失败。 根因：SWE-smith 训练数据是 intra-repo 检索（query 与 candidates 来自同一 repo）， 而 SWE-bench\n44\t    是 cross-repo 设置（模型未见过的 repo）。Contrastive fine-tuning在小 pool  内 intra-repo 检索上过拟合，丧失了\n45\t    pretrained encoder 的 cross-repo 泛化能力。 BM25 因为是 lexical matching（不依赖 learned representations）所以不受此影响。\n46\t\n47\t    在 best tier 下，这一失败被 strategically 利用：(1) 诚实报告增强论文可信度， (2) 明确 scope boundary \"our\n48\t    results apply to intra-repo retrieval settings\"， (3) 激发 future work 方向 \"bridging\n49\t    the intra/cross-repo gap\"。 RepoBench-R 替代作为 held-out evaluation（仍是 cross-file\n50\t    但 repo-aware 设置）。\n51\t\n52\t    '\n53\t  tables:\n54\t  - name: 'Table S4: SWE-bench OOD Evaluation (Limitation)'\n55\t    columns:\n56\t    - Retriever\n57\t    - R@1\n58\t    - R@5\n59\t    - R@10\n60\t    - MRR\n61\t    - N\n62\t    rows:\n63\t    - - BM25 (reference)\n64\t      - 0.273\n65\t      - 0.467\n66\t      - 0.55\n67\t      - 0.36\n68\t      - 300\n69\t    - - StructFuse-random\n70\t      - 0.04\n71\t      - 0.11\n72\t      - 0.14\n73\t      - 0.07\n74\t      - 100\n75\t  figures_description:\n76\t  - 'Fig S7: SWE-bench R@K curve showing neural retriever collapse below BM25 at all\n77\t    K'\n78\t  analysis: 'SWE-bench failure 在 best tier 下反而加强了论文：它划定了清晰的 scope boundary， 展示了作者的自我审视能力。Reviewer\n79\t    concern \"no downstream eval\" 由 RepoBench-R 回应， SWE-bench 失败则作为 honest limitation\n80\t    处理，1-2 段落放在 Limitations section。\n81\t\n82\t    '\n83\t- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with 3-Seed Bootstrap CIs\n84\t  plan_id: plan_004\n85\t  description: 'RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 3 seeds\n86\t    ×  3 strategies × 2 encoders（Qwen, StarCoder）。报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。 这是\n87\t    SWE-bench 失败后的替代 held-out external validation。\n88\t\n89\t    '\n90\t  expected_results:\n91\t    qwen_test_hard:\n92\t      random_R1_mean: 0.62\n93\t      random_R1_ci:\n94\t      - 0.615\n95\t      - 0.625\n96\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.632\n97\t      embedding_R1_ci:\n98\t      - 0.626\n99\t      - 0.638\n100\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.626\n101\t      dataflow_R1_ci:\n102\t      - 0.62\n103\t      - 0.632\n104\t      bm25_R1_mean: 0.601\n105\t      bm25_R1_ci:\n106\t      - 0.595\n107\t      - 0.607\n108\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n109\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -1.9\n110\t    qwen_test_easy:\n111\t      random_R1_mean: 0.842\n112\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.851\n113\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.847\n114\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n115\t    starcoder_test_hard:\n116\t      random_R1_mean: 0.571\n117\t      random_R1_ci:\n118\t      - 0.565\n119\t      - 0.577\n120\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.579\n121\t      embedding_R1_ci:\n122\t      - 0.573\n123\t      - 0.585\n124\t      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.568\n125\t      dataflow_R1_ci:\n126\t      - 0.562\n127\t      - 0.574\n128\t      bm25_R1_mean: 0.553\n129\t      bm25_R1_ci:\n130\t      - 0.547\n131\t      - 0.559\n132\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n133\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -1.8\n134\t    starcoder_test_easy:\n135\t      random_R1_mean: 0.81\n136\t      embedding_R1_mean: 0.816\n137\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n138\t    repobench_embed_vs_random_avg_pp: 1.0\n139\t    CI_non_overlapping_embed_vs_random: true\n140\t    bootstrap_N: 10000\n141\t  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file code completion 任务，与 SWE-smith (bug-fix\n142\t    retrieval)  领域不同但任务结构相似（从 repo 内候选文件中检索正确文件）。Pool=18 (test_hard) 提供 足够的 distractor\n143\t    使 mining 质量差异体现。\n144\t\n145\t    Embedding mining 在 test_hard 上持续帮助两个 encoder（Qwen +1.2pp, StarCoder +0.8pp）， 因为\n146\t    harder negatives 训练使 encoder 更善于区分 \"semantically similar but functionally  distinct\"\n147\t    文件——这一能力跨任务泛化。CIs non-overlapping 因为 8K test instances 提供 足够的统计功效，即使只有 3 seeds，instance-level\n148\t    bootstrap 也能给出 tight CIs。\n149\t\n150\t    BM25 negatives 在 RepoBench-R 上同样 harm（-1.8 to -1.9pp），与 SWE-smith 一致， 说明 BM25\n151\t    harm 不是 benchmark-specific artifact 而是 strategy 固有问题。\n152\t\n153\t    Test_easy (pool=6) 上 delta 压缩至 0.6-0.9pp 是预期的 ceiling effect—— 6 candidates 中选对\n154\t    1 个的 baseline 已经很高。\n155\t\n156\t    Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +0.6pp 但 CI 与 random 接近重叠， StarCoder 上 -0.3pp（CI 含零）——与\n157\t    SWE-smith encoder-strategy interaction 一致。\n158\t\n159\t    '\n160\t  tables:\n161\t  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n162\t    columns:\n163\t    - Encoder\n164\t    - Strategy\n165\t    - R@1 (%)\n166\t    - 95% CI\n167\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n168\t    rows:\n169\t    - - Qwen\n170\t      - BM25\n171\t      - 60.1\n172\t      - '[59.5, 60.7]'\n173\t      - '-1.9'\n174\t    - - Qwen\n175\t      - random\n176\t      - 62.0\n177\t      - '[61.5, 62.5]'\n178\t      - —\n179\t    - - Qwen\n180\t      - dataflow\n181\t      - 62.6\n182\t      - '[62.0, 63.2]'\n183\t      - '+0.6'\n184\t    - - Qwen\n185\t      - embedding\n186\t      - 63.2\n187\t      - '[62.6, 63.8]'\n188\t      - '+1.2'\n189\t    - - StarCoder\n190\t      - BM25\n191\t      - 55.3\n192\t      - '[54.7, 55.9]'\n193\t      - '-1.8'\n194\t    - - StarCoder\n195\t      - random\n196\t      - 57.1\n197\t      - '[56.5, 57.7]'\n198\t      - —\n199\t    - - StarCoder\n200\t      - dataflow\n201\t      - 56.8\n202\t      - '[56.2, 57.4]'\n203\t      - '-0.3'\n204\t    - - StarCoder\n205\t      - embedding\n206\t      - 57.9\n207\t      - '[57.3, 58.5]'\n208\t      - '+0.8'\n209\t  figures_description:\n210\t  - 'Fig 5: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 4 strategies) with CI\n211\t    whiskers'\n212\t  - 'Fig 5b: test_easy vs test_hard side-by-side, showing ceiling compression'\n213\t  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 核心证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和  RepoBench-R\n214\t    上均显著提升两个 encoder，BM25 均 harm。这排除了 \"单 benchmark artifact\"  reviewer concern。Strategy\n215\t    ranking BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 完美保持。 test_easy ceiling effect 间接验证了\n216\t    pool size 对效果幅度的调节作用（与 plan_019 互补）。\n217\t\n218\t    '\n219\t- name: Stratified Analysis with 5 Strata (D062 Query-Split Evaluation)\n220\t  plan_id: plan_005\n221\t  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity /  structural\n222\t    data availability (90% with m1_reextract_v2 vs 10% remaining errors) /  neg_difficulty\n223\t    quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints 在 D062 query-split held-out  evaluation 上重新评估。\n224\t\n225\t    '\n226\t  expected_results:\n227\t    stratum_structural_available:\n228\t      with_dataflow_90pct:\n229\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n230\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n231\t        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.2\n232\t        n_instances: ~13000\n233\t        note: m1_reextract_v2 提升 coverage 从 34% 到 90%\n234\t      no_dataflow_10pct:\n235\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n236\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n237\t        n_instances: ~1400\n238\t    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n239\t      Q1_easiest:\n240\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n241\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.2\n242\t      Q2:\n243\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n244\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.5\n245\t      Q3:\n246\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.7\n247\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n248\t      Q4_hardest:\n249\t        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 2.3\n250\t        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n251\t    stratum_repo_size:\n252\t      small_lt50:\n253\t        embedding_delta_pp: 2.0\n254\t        n: ~500\n255\t      medium_50_200:\n256\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n257\t        n: ~4100\n258\t      large_200_500:\n259\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.3\n260\t        n: ~5500\n261\t      xlarge_500plus:\n262\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n263\t        n: ~5100\n264\t    stratum_pool_size:\n265\t      pool_lt20:\n266\t        embedding_delta_pp: 0.7\n267\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n268\t      pool_20_50:\n269\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.5\n270\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.6\n271\t      pool_gt50:\n272\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n273\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.9\n274\t    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n275\t      high_sim_gt095:\n276\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n277\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.2\n278\t      medium_sim_085_095:\n279\t        embedding_delta_pp: 1.3\n280\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.5\n281\t      low_sim_lt085:\n282\t        embedding_delta_pp: 0.8\n283\t        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.1\n284\t  result_rationale: 'm1_reextract_v2 将 structural data rate 从 34% 提升到 90%，彻底改变了 structural  stratum\n285\t    分析。90% stratum 上 dataflow Δ=+0.8pp（显著）因为绝大部分 instance 现在 获得真实 dataflow-disconnected\n286\t    negatives。10% remaining errors 上 dataflow 退化为  random（Δ≈0），因为缺乏结构数据意味着 fallback\n287\t    策略无差异。\n288\t\n289\t    Neg difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）embed Δ=+2.3pp 是 overall 的 ~1.6 倍——越难的  instance（margin\n290\t    最小）从 harder negatives 获益最多，这是 representation saturation  理论的直接预测。Q1（最易）Δ 最小（0.6pp）因为\n291\t    random negatives 已足够区分。\n292\t\n293\t    Repo size 上 small repo Δ 最大（2.0pp）因为小 repo candidate pool 集中，mining  质量差异更容易体现。Pool\n294\t    size > 50 时 delta 增大到 1.9pp，说明 mining 在更大搜索 空间下更有价值。\n295\t\n296\t    Query-positive similarity 分层显示 high sim（>0.95）时 delta 最大，与 Qwen  saturation 分析一致——高相似度区域是\n297\t    embedding mining 最有价值的场景。\n298\t\n299\t    '\n300\t  tables:\n301\t  - name: 'Table 6: Stratified Embed-Random Δ by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen, D062\n302\t      eval)'\n303\t    columns:\n304\t    - Quartile\n305\t    - margin_mean\n306\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n307\t    - df−rand (pp)\n308\t    rows:\n309\t    - - Q1 (easiest)\n310\t      - 0.135\n311\t      - '+0.6'\n312\t      - '+0.2'\n313\t    - - Q2\n314\t      - 0.072\n315\t      - '+1.1'\n316\t      - '+0.5'\n317\t    - - Q3\n318\t      - 0.028\n319\t      - '+1.7'\n320\t      - '+0.9'\n321\t    - - Q4 (hardest)\n322\t      - 0.007\n323\t      - '+2.3'\n324\t      - '+1.5'\n325\t  - name: 'Table 6b: Stratified by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n326\t    columns:\n327\t    - Stratum\n328\t    - N\n329\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n330\t    - df−rand (pp)\n331\t    rows:\n332\t    - - With dataflow (90%)\n333\t      - ~13K\n334\t      - '+1.3'\n335\t      - '+0.8'\n336\t    - - No dataflow (10%)\n337\t      - ~1.4K\n338\t      - '+1.4'\n339\t      - '+0.1'\n340\t  figures_description:\n341\t  - 'Fig 6: Neg difficulty quartile × strategy interaction line plot'\n342\t  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n343\t    StarCoder'\n344\t  analysis: 'Neg difficulty quartile 分析是 best tier 最强 mechanistic 证据。Q4 的 2.3pp  embed\n345\t    delta 是 overall 1.4pp 的 1.6 倍——直接验证 \"harder instances benefit more  from harder\n346\t    negatives\" 的理论预测。Structural availability 分析从 34%→90% coverage  升级后说服力大增——90% stratum\n347\t    的 dataflow Δ=+0.8pp 是 clean signal。 Confound analysis（rich-dataflow 99.3% 在 large/xlarge\n348\t    repo）仍需控制 repo size  来隔离 dataflow richness 独立效应。\n349\t\n350\t    '\n351\t- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n352\t  plan_id: plan_007\n353\t  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量影响。\n354\t    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。使用 m1_reextract_v2 数据（90% coverage）。\n355\t\n356\t    '\n357\t  expected_results:\n358\t    hop_1:\n359\t      R1: 0.548\n360\t      connected_coverage_pct: 15.2\n361\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 21.4\n362\t    hop_2:\n363\t      R1: 0.558\n364\t      connected_coverage_pct: 45.8\n365\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 38.6\n366\t    hop_3:\n367\t      R1: 0.553\n368\t      connected_coverage_pct: 72.1\n369\t      negatives_per_query_mean: 55.3\n370\t    optimal_hop: 2\n371\t    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 1.0\n372\t    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.5\n373\t  result_rationale: 'm1_reextract_v2 90% coverage 下，各 hop depth 的 connected coverage\n374\t    均高于原 34%。 2-hop 最优因为：(1) 1-hop 仅覆盖 15.2% instances（直接 caller/callee），大部分 instance  没有足够\n375\t    connected nodes 定义 meaningful disconnection，退化为 random；(2) 3-hop  coverage 72.1%\n376\t    过高，\"disconnected\" 定义过窄——许多语义相关但 3-hop 可达的文件被错误排除 在 negative pool 外；(3) 2-hop coverage\n377\t    45.8%（近一半 instance 有 meaningful  structural signal）平衡了 signal quality 和 coverage。\n378\t\n379\t    2-hop 对应 inter-procedural 语义：直接 caller/callee + 一层间接调用。 这是 principled 选择而非纯 empirical\n380\t    tuning。\n381\t\n382\t    '\n383\t  tables:\n384\t  - name: 'Table S1: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n385\t    columns:\n386\t    - Hops\n387\t    - Coverage (%)\n388\t    - Neg/query\n389\t    - R@1 (%)\n390\t    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n391\t    rows:\n392\t    - - 1\n393\t      - 15.2\n394\t      - 21.4\n395\t      - 54.8\n396\t      - '-1.0'\n397\t    - - 2\n398\t      - 45.8\n399\t      - 38.6\n400\t      - 55.8\n401\t      - —\n402\t    - - 3\n403\t      - 72.1\n404\t      - 55.3\n405\t      - 55.3\n406\t      - '-0.5'\n407\t  figures_description:\n408\t  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n409\t  analysis: 'Inverted-U pattern（1-hop < 2-hop > 3-hop）支持 \"optimal structural granularity\"  narrative。2-hop\n410\t    + m1_reextract_v2 (90% coverage) 的组合是论文推荐配置。\n411\t\n412\t    '\n413\t- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K instances)\n414\t  plan_id: plan_008\n415\t  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + 3 strategies，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances 增长， 观察\n416\t    R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。1 seed per size。\n417\t\n418\t    '\n419\t  expected_results:\n420\t    size_1K:\n421\t      random_R1: 0.515\n422\t      embedding_R1: 0.524\n423\t      dataflow_R1: 0.518\n424\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n425\t      seed_std: 0.018\n426\t    size_3K:\n427\t      random_R1: 0.54\n428\t      embedding_R1: 0.552\n429\t      dataflow_R1: 0.545\n430\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n431\t      seed_std: 0.012\n432\t    size_5K:\n433\t      random_R1: 0.553\n434\t      embedding_R1: 0.567\n435\t      dataflow_R1: 0.559\n436\t      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n437\t      seed_std: 0.009\n438\t    ranking_stable: true\n439\t    monotonic_improvement: true\n440\t  result_rationale: '策略排名在 3 个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），delta 幅度随数据量\n441\t    增大而增大（1K: 0.9pp → 5K: 1.4pp）。更大训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，mining  策略差异更充分体现。1K\n442\t    时 seed variance 较大（1.8pp std）因为 negative 多样性不足， 个别 seed 的采样偶然性影响结果。5K 时 variance\n443\t    收敛至 0.9pp。 No diminishing returns at 5K 暗示进一步 scaling 可能有益。\n444\t\n445\t    '\n446\t  tables:\n447\t  - name: 'Table S2: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n448\t    columns:\n449\t    - Size\n450\t    - random\n451\t    - embedding\n452\t    - dataflow\n453\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n454\t    - σ (pp)\n455\t    rows:\n456\t    - - 1K\n457\t      - 51.5\n458\t      - 52.4\n459\t      - 51.8\n460\t      - '+0.9'\n461\t      - 1.8\n462\t    - - 3K\n463\t      - 54.0\n464\t      - 55.2\n465\t      - 54.5\n466\t      - '+1.2'\n467\t      - 1.2\n468\t    - - 5K\n469\t      - 55.3\n470\t      - 56.7\n471\t      - 55.9\n472\t      - '+1.4'\n473\t      - 0.9\n474\t  figures_description:\n475\t  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies with shaded variance bands'\n476\t  analysis: 'Stable ranking + growing delta 说明 mining effect 不是 small-data artifact。\n477\t    5K 未达 diminishing returns，当前 delta 是下界不是上界——回应 \"effect marginal\" concern。\n478\t\n479\t    '\n480\t- name: Fusion Head Ablation (mining vs inference-time features)\n481\t  plan_id: plan_009\n482\t  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head。\n483\t    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。 Qwen + StarCoder,\n484\t    best embedding checkpoint。\n485\t\n486\t    '\n487\t  expected_results:\n488\t    embedding_only:\n489\t      qwen_R1: 0.567\n490\t      starcoder_R1: 0.485\n491\t    structural_features_only:\n492\t      qwen_R1: 0.501\n493\t      starcoder_R1: 0.422\n494\t    combined_fusion:\n495\t      qwen_R1: 0.564\n496\t      starcoder_R1: 0.483\n497\t    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.3\n498\t    embedding_only_minus_structural_only_pp: 6.6\n499\t    conclusion: mining >> fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n500\t  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（mining 训练，inference 不注入结构特征）表现最好或 tied with combined。\n501\t    Combined 略低 0.3pp 因为 inference-time structural features 引入不精确信号—— 即使 m1_reextract_v2\n502\t    coverage 90%，仍有 10% instance 收到 zero-vector structural  features 引入 noise。\n503\t\n504\t    Structural-features-only（不用 mining，仅 inference 时注入）远低于 embedding-only （-6.6pp\n505\t    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time  feature engineering。Paper\n506\t    可据此明确：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n507\t\n508\t    '\n509\t  tables:\n510\t  - name: 'Table S3: Fusion Head Ablation'\n511\t    columns:\n512\t    - Configuration\n513\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n514\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n515\t    rows:\n516\t    - - embedding-only (ours)\n517\t      - 56.7\n518\t      - 48.5\n519\t    - - structural-features-only\n520\t      - 50.1\n521\t      - 42.2\n522\t    - - combined fusion\n523\t      - 56.4\n524\t      - 48.3\n525\t  figures_description:\n526\t  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n527\t  analysis: 'Mining（间接 structural signal）> fusion（直接 structural features）。 原因：mining\n528\t    让 encoder 自己学习 structure-relevant representations， 直接注入 features 绕过了学习过程且引入 coverage\n529\t    noise。强化论文 narrative。\n530\t\n531\t    '\n532\t- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n533\t  plan_id: plan_010\n534\t  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n535\t    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件赋予更高采样概率。\n536\t\n537\t    '\n538\t  expected_results:\n539\t    binary_qwen_R1: 0.559\n540\t    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.561\n541\t    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.472\n542\t    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.473\n543\t    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.2\n544\t    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n545\t    significant: false\n546\t  result_rationale: 'Weighted 仅微弱提升 +0.1~0.2pp（不显著）。Binary disconnected/connected\n547\t    已捕获 最关键的 structural distinction——\"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance 加权引入的 额外信号被 noise\n548\t    抵消：距离更远 ≠ 更好 negative（utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是  trivial negative）。Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer\n549\t    hyperparameters, same effect。\n550\t\n551\t    '\n552\t  tables:\n553\t  - name: 'Table S5: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n554\t    columns:\n555\t    - Method\n556\t    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n557\t    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n558\t    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n559\t    rows:\n560\t    - - Binary (default)\n561\t      - 55.9\n562\t      - 47.2\n563\t      - —\n564\t    - - Distance-weighted\n565\t      - 56.1\n566\t      - 47.3\n567\t      - +0.2 / +0.1\n568\t  figures_description: []\n569\t  analysis: 'Binary sufficient — weighted complexity not justified。 论文 ablation section\n570\t    用一句话报告，强化 \"simple binary is the key insight\"。\n571\t\n572\t    '\n573\t- name: SWE-smith Retrieval Failure Analysis (repurposed from SWE-bench)\n574\t  plan_id: plan_011\n575\t  description: '原计划分析 SWE-bench 失败案例。SWE-bench 已失败（R@1=0.04, OOD），改为分析 SWE-smith validation\n576\t    上 random retriever 失败的 50 个案例，分类失败原因， 标注 embedding/dataflow mining 能否帮助。\n577\t\n578\t    '\n579\t  expected_results:\n580\t    total_analyzed: 50\n581\t    source: SWE-smith validation set (intra-repo setting)\n582\t    category_breakdown:\n583\t      similar_but_wrong_file: 19\n584\t      distant_but_correct_file: 12\n585\t      pool_saturation_all_similar: 9\n586\t      query_ambiguity: 6\n587\t      singleton_gold_no_candidates: 4\n588\t    mining_would_help:\n589\t      embedding_helps: 17\n590\t      dataflow_helps: 8\n591\t      neither_helps: 25\n592\t    embedding_help_rate: 0.34\n593\t    dataflow_additional_help_rate: 0.16\n594\t  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 19 个是 \"similar but wrong\"——检索到与 gold 高文本相似但非同一 call chain  的文件。Embedding\n595\t    mining 训练可帮助其中 17 个（让 encoder 学会区分高相似度区域内的细微差异）。 Dataflow 额外帮助 8 个涉及跨模块调用链的案例（embedding\n596\t    mining 无法捕获的 structural  dependencies）。25 个 \"neither helps\" 主要是 pool saturation（候选全部高度相似）和  query\n597\t    ambiguity（issue 描述模糊无法定位）。\n598\t\n599\t    34% embedding help rate 与 observed 1.0-1.4pp delta 一致： 如果 34% 的失败中有一部分被修正，对应 ~1-2pp\n600\t    总体提升。\n601\t\n602\t    '\n603\t  tables:\n604\t  - name: 'Table S6: Failure Category Breakdown (SWE-smith)'\n605\t    columns:\n606\t    - Category\n607\t    - Count\n608\t    - '% of 50'\n609\t    - Mining Helps?\n610\t    rows:\n611\t    - - Similar but wrong file\n612\t      - 19\n613\t      - 38\n614\t      - 17/19 (embed)\n615\t    - - Distant correct file\n616\t      - 12\n617\t      - 24\n618\t      - 8/12 (dataflow)\n619\t    - - Pool saturation\n620\t      - 9\n621\t      - 18\n622\t      - 2/9 (partial)\n623\t    - - Query ambiguity\n624\t      - 6\n625\t      - 12\n626\t      - 0/6\n627\t    - - Singleton gold\n628\t      - 4\n629\t      - 8\n630\t      - 0/4\n631\t  figures_description:\n632\t  - 'Fig S4: Failure category pie chart with mining-could-help overlay'\n633\t  analysis: 'Failure analysis 将抽象 delta 转化为具体机制。\"Similar but wrong\" 是最大失败类别 且最易被 embedding\n634\t    mining 修正——直接支持 Claim 1 的 mechanistic explanation。\n635\t\n636\t    '\n637\t- name: Qualitative Examples (5-8 cases from SWE-smith)\n638\t  plan_id: plan_012\n639\t  description: '从 SWE-smith 中选取 5-8 个 embedding/dataflow mining 改变检索结果的典型案例。 （原依赖\n640\t    SWE-bench，现改用 SWE-smith internal data。）\n641\t\n642\t    '\n643\t  expected_results:\n644\t    total_examples: 7\n645\t    example_categories:\n646\t      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n647\t      utility_file_distraction: 2\n648\t      cross_module_import_chain: 1\n649\t      test_vs_source: 1\n650\t    illustrative_example:\n651\t      repo: sample-python-project\n652\t      query: issue about incorrect cache invalidation\n653\t      random_top1: cache/utils.py (lexical match on 'cache')\n654\t      embedding_top1: cache/backend.py (semantically similar, shares embedding cluster)\n655\t      dataflow_top1: cache/backend.py + storage/driver.py (caller chain)\n656\t      gold: cache/backend.py\n657\t  result_rationale: '7 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式。Caller-callee confusion（3 个）最常见——文本相似的  wrapper\n658\t    函数 vs 实际实现是 code retrieval 的核心挑战。案例具体展示了  \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\"，使抽象的\n659\t    representation geometry  论证变得具体可感。\n660\t\n661\t    '\n662\t  tables: []\n663\t  figures_description:\n664\t  - 'Fig 8: Side-by-side retrieval ranking for 3 representative cases with dependency\n665\t    graph overlay'\n666\t  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 是论文 \"aha moment\"——即使对统计显著性持怀疑态度的 reviewer， 也能通过具体案例理解\n667\t    mining 策略的作用机制。\n668\t\n669\t    '\n670\t- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} (Full)\n671\t  plan_id: plan_014\n672\t  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each。 测试 strategy\n673\t    ranking 是否 temperature-regime-specific。 （plan_021 为 reduced 版本；如果时间足够，运行 full\n674\t    plan_014。）\n675\t\n676\t    '\n677\t  expected_results:\n678\t    tau_005:\n679\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.56\n680\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.576\n681\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.568\n682\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n683\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.487\n684\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.497\n685\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n686\t    tau_010:\n687\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.553\n688\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.567\n689\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.559\n690\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n691\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.479\n692\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n693\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n694\t    tau_020:\n695\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.538\n696\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.55\n697\t      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.544\n698\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n699\t      starcoder_random_R1: 0.465\n700\t      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.472\n701\t      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n702\t    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n703\t    optimal_tau: 0.05\n704\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n705\t    > random ≈  dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 τ 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高——sharper temperature  使\n706\t    contrastive loss 更有效地放大相似度差异。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小（1.2pp vs 1.4pp  for Qwen）——softer\n707\t    temperature 压缩所有 similarity 到窄范围，减弱 hard vs easy  negatives 的梯度差异。\n708\t\n709\t    关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific。直接回应 median reviewer 的  \"τ=0.05 unusually\n710\t    low\" concern。τ=0.1 作为 paper default（literature convention）， τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n711\t    best configuration 在 ablation 报告。\n712\t\n713\t    '\n714\t  tables:\n715\t  - name: 'Table 7: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n716\t    columns:\n717\t    - τ\n718\t    - Encoder\n719\t    - random\n720\t    - embedding\n721\t    - dataflow\n722\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n723\t    rows:\n724\t    - - 0.05\n725\t      - Qwen\n726\t      - 56.0\n727\t      - 57.6\n728\t      - 56.8\n729\t      - '+1.6'\n730\t    - - 0.05\n731\t      - StarCoder\n732\t      - 48.7\n733\t      - 49.7\n734\t      - 48.5\n735\t      - '+1.0'\n736\t    - - 0.1\n737\t      - Qwen\n738\t      - 55.3\n739\t      - 56.7\n740\t      - 55.9\n741\t      - '+1.4'\n742\t    - - 0.1\n743\t      - StarCoder\n744\t      - 47.9\n745\t      - 48.5\n746\t      - 47.4\n747\t      - '+0.6'\n748\t    - - 0.2\n749\t      - Qwen\n750\t      - 53.8\n751\t      - 55.0\n752\t      - 54.4\n753\t      - '+1.2'\n754\t    - - 0.2\n755\t      - StarCoder\n756\t      - 46.5\n757\t      - 47.2\n758\t      - 46.3\n759\t      - '+0.7'\n760\t  figures_description:\n761\t  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot, separate panels per encoder'\n762\t  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是关键 robustness 证据。τ=0.2 delta 缩小但不翻转—— mining\n763\t    quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。\n764\t\n765\t    '\n766\t- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n767\t  plan_id: plan_015\n768\t  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 用当前 encoder 重新挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n769\t    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。Phase 2 (GPU) QUEUED。\n770\t\n771\t    '\n772\t  expected_results:\n773\t    qwen_static_R1: 0.567\n774\t    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.569\n775\t    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n776\t    starcoder_static_R1: 0.485\n777\t    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.486\n778\t    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.1\n779\t    dynamic_significant: false\n780\t    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n781\t  result_rationale: 'Dynamic 仅微弱提升 +0.1~0.2pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 fine-tuning 只轻微\n782\t    改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 训练后大部分不变。 这排除了 \"static\n783\t    mining 优势来自 curriculum effect (early hard → stale negatives)\"  的 confound。\n784\t\n785\t    对 Claim 2 重要：mining strategy 的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule  （when to mine）更关键。Dynamic\n786\t    的 compute overhead（每 epoch 重新 encode + kNN） not justified——强化 \"zero-cost\" framing。\n787\t\n788\t    '\n789\t  tables:\n790\t  - name: 'Table S7: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n791\t    columns:\n792\t    - Encoder\n793\t    - Static R@1 (%)\n794\t    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n795\t    - Δ (pp)\n796\t    - p-value\n797\t    rows:\n798\t    - - Qwen\n799\t      - 56.7\n800\t      - 56.9\n801\t      - '+0.2'\n802\t      - 0.44\n803\t    - - StarCoder\n804\t      - 48.5\n805\t      - 48.6\n806\t      - '+0.1'\n807\t      - 0.56\n808\t  figures_description:\n809\t  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n810\t  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result。强化 \"mine once from pretrained,  no\n811\t    re-mining needed\" 的 practitioner recommendation。\n812\t\n813\t    '\n814\t- name: Bootstrap CIs for M2 Main Results + RepoBench-R\n815\t  plan_id: plan_016\n816\t  description: '原为 SWE-bench CIs，现 repurpose 为 M2 main results (D062 query-split eval)  和\n817\t    RepoBench-R 的 paired bootstrap 95% CIs。10K resamples。 统一统计框架覆盖所有 pairwise comparisons。\n818\t\n819\t    '\n820\t  expected_results:\n821\t    m2_query_split_eval:\n822\t      qwen_embed_minus_random:\n823\t        delta_pp: 1.4\n824\t        ci_95:\n825\t        - 0.5\n826\t        - 2.3\n827\t        p_value: 0.012\n828\t        significant: true\n829\t      starcoder_embed_minus_random:\n830\t        delta_pp: 0.9\n831\t        ci_95:\n832\t        - 0.1\n833\t        - 1.7\n834\t        p_value: 0.038\n835\t        significant: true\n836\t      qwen_bm25_minus_random:\n837\t        delta_pp: -2.9\n838\t        ci_95:\n839\t        - -4.1\n840\t        - -1.7\n841\t        p_value: 0.001\n842\t        significant: true\n843\t      starcoder_bm25_minus_random:\n844\t        delta_pp: -2.5\n845\t        ci_95:\n846\t        - -3.8\n847\t        - -1.2\n848\t        p_value: 0.003\n849\t        significant: true\n850\t      qwen_dataflow_minus_random:\n851\t        delta_pp: 0.7\n852\t        ci_95:\n853\t        - -0.2\n854\t        - 1.6\n855\t        p_value: 0.089\n856\t        significant: false\n857\t    repobench_r_test_hard:\n858\t      qwen_embed_minus_random:\n859\t        delta_pp: 1.2\n860\t        ci_95:\n861\t        - 0.6\n862\t        - 1.8\n863\t        p_value: 0.002\n864\t        significant: true\n865\t      starcoder_embed_minus_random:\n866\t        delta_pp: 0.8\n867\t        ci_95:\n868\t        - 0.2\n869\t        - 1.4\n870\t        p_value: 0.014\n871\t        significant: true\n872\t    bootstrap_n: 10000\n873\t    all_embed_vs_random_exclude_zero: true\n874\t    all_bm25_vs_random_exclude_zero: true\n875\t  result_rationale: 'D062 query-split eval 上 embed vs random CI 下界 > 0 for both encoders，\n876\t    confirming statistical significance。BM25 vs random CI 上界 < 0，confirming harm。\n877\t    Dataflow vs random 在 Qwen 上 borderline（p=0.089, CI 含零）——consistent with  Claim\n878\t    2 的 \"exploratory/conditional\" framing。\n879\t\n880\t    RepoBench-R CIs 更 tight（8K test instances 提供更大统计功效），两个 encoder  embed vs random\n881\t    均显著。Cross-benchmark significance 是 Claim 1 的 statistical  closure。\n882\t\n883\t    3 seeds 的 seed-level variance 通过 instance-level bootstrap 吸收—— CI 主要反映 instance-level\n884\t    variability 而非 seed variance，这对 3-seed 设计 是有利的（seed 数少不直接导致 CI 变宽，因为每个 seed 有大量\n885\t    instance）。\n886\t\n887\t    '\n888\t  tables:\n889\t  - name: 'Table 3: Main Results with Bootstrap 95% CIs (D062 query-split)'\n890\t    columns:\n891\t    - Encoder\n892\t    - Comparison\n893\t    - Δ (pp)\n894\t    - 95% CI\n895\t    - p-value\n896\t    rows:\n897\t    - - Qwen\n898\t      - embed − random\n899\t      - '+1.4'\n900\t      - '[+0.5, +2.3]'\n901\t      - 0.012\n902\t    - - Qwen\n903\t      - dataflow − random\n904\t      - '+0.7'\n905\t      - '[−0.2, +1.6]'\n906\t      - 0.089\n907\t    - - Qwen\n908\t      - BM25 − random\n909\t      - −2.9\n910\t      - '[−4.1, −1.7]'\n911\t      - 0.001\n912\t    - - StarCoder\n913\t      - embed − random\n914\t      - '+0.9'\n915\t      - '[+0.1, +1.7]'\n916\t      - 0.038\n917\t    - - StarCoder\n918\t      - dataflow − random\n919\t      - −0.5\n920\t      - '[−1.4, +0.4]'\n921\t      - 0.21\n922\t    - - StarCoder\n923\t      - BM25 − random\n924\t      - −2.5\n925\t      - '[−3.8, −1.2]'\n926\t      - 0.003\n927\t  figures_description:\n928\t  - 'Fig 4: Forest plot showing pairwise deltas with 95% CIs for all comparisons'\n929\t  - 'Fig 4b: Bootstrap distribution histograms for embed−random (both encoders)'\n930\t  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for embed, 上界 < 0 for BM25, dataflow borderline——这是理想的 statistical\n931\t    picture for the best tier。Three-tier significance pattern  (BM25 harm ✓, embed\n932\t    help ✓, dataflow conditional ?) 完美映射到三条 claims。\n933\t\n934\t    '\n935\t- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n936\t  plan_id: plan_018\n937\t  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略。Phase 1 (CPU) DONE：BM25 index built，\n938\t    training data mined（11K+ records/seed, k=50）。Phase 2 (GPU)：train 3 seeds ×  2\n939\t    encoders。验证 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n940\t\n941\t    '\n942\t  expected_results:\n943\t    qwen:\n944\t      bm25_s42_R1: 0.535\n945\t      bm25_s43_R1: 0.538\n946\t      bm25_s44_R1: 0.541\n947\t      bm25_mean_R1: 0.538\n948\t      random_mean_R1: 0.57\n949\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -3.2\n950\t      embed_mean_R1: 0.573\n951\t      embed_minus_bm25_pp: 3.5\n952\t    starcoder:\n953\t      bm25_s42_R1: 0.452\n954\t      bm25_s43_R1: 0.462\n955\t      bm25_s44_R1: 0.458\n956\t      bm25_mean_R1: 0.457\n957\t      random_mean_R1: 0.479\n958\t      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.2\n959\t      embed_mean_R1: 0.485\n960\t      embed_minus_bm25_pp: 2.8\n961\t    bm25_harms_both_encoders: true\n962\t    cocohanere_artifact_confirmed: true\n963\t    bm25_minus_random_avg_pp: -2.7\n964\t    bm25_overlap_context:\n965\t      bm25_vs_embedding_top7_jaccard_large_repos: 0.297\n966\t      bm25_vs_random_top7_jaccard_large_repos: 0.007\n967\t  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm（Qwen -3.2pp, StarCoder -2.2pp），\n968\t    mean -2.7pp 位于 best 档 [-3.0, -1.0] 范围内。\n969\t\n970\t    BM25 选取的是 lexically similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——共享大量  token overlap（函数名、变量名、import\n971\t    patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive  learning 用来区分 positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25\n972\t    选的 negatives 使模型学会  ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在 code retrieval 中是有效信号。\n973\t\n974\t    Overlap 分析（phase 1 已完成）支持这一解释：大 repo 上 BM25 与 embedding  top-7 Jaccard 仅 0.297——两种\n975\t    mining 选取的 negatives 差异很大。BM25 与 random  仅 0.007——说明 BM25 negatives 与 random sampling\n976\t    几乎无交集（高度 targeted）， 但 targeted 到了错误方向。\n977\t\n978\t    这直接回应 CoCoHaNeRe (ACM TOSEM 2025)：他们报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\"  实际是 BM25-proxy\n979\t    artifact。True embedding distance negatives 方向相反（+0.6~1.4pp）。 BM25 vs embedding\n980\t    的 3.5pp 差距是论文最大的 single pairwise comparison。\n981\t\n982\t    '\n983\t  tables:\n984\t  - name: 'Table 2: Full 4-Strategy Comparison (Standard Eval, best_by_R@1)'\n985\t    columns:\n986\t    - Encoder\n987\t    - Strategy\n988\t    - Mean R@1 (%)\n989\t    - 95% CI\n990\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n991\t    rows:\n992\t    - - Qwen\n993\t      - BM25\n994\t      - 53.8\n995\t      - '[52.9, 54.7]'\n996\t      - −3.2\n997\t    - - Qwen\n998\t      - random\n999\t      - 57.0\n1000\t      - '[55.5, 58.5]'\n1001\t      - —\n1002\t    - - Qwen\n1003\t      - dataflow\n1004\t      - 55.9\n1005\t      - '[55.3, 56.5]'\n1006\t      - −1.1\n1007\t    - - Qwen\n1008\t      - embedding\n1009\t      - 57.3\n1010\t      - '[56.5, 58.1]'\n1011\t      - '+0.3'\n1012\t    - - StarCoder\n1013\t      - BM25\n1014\t      - 45.7\n1015\t      - '[44.8, 46.6]'\n1016\t      - −2.2\n1017\t    - - StarCoder\n1018\t      - random\n1019\t      - 47.9\n1020\t      - '[46.0, 49.0]'\n1021\t      - —\n1022\t    - - StarCoder\n1023\t      - dataflow\n1024\t      - 47.2\n1025\t      - '[46.5, 47.9]'\n1026\t      - −0.7\n1027\t    - - StarCoder\n1028\t      - embedding\n1029\t      - 48.5\n1030\t      - '[47.2, 50.1]'\n1031\t      - '+0.6'\n1032\t  - name: 'Table 2b: 4-Strategy on D062 Query-Split Eval'\n1033\t    columns:\n1034\t    - Encoder\n1035\t    - Strategy\n1036\t    - Mean R@1 (%)\n1037\t    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n1038\t    rows:\n1039\t    - - Qwen\n1040\t      - BM25\n1041\t      - 33.2\n1042\t      - −2.9\n1043\t    - - Qwen\n1044\t      - random\n1045\t      - 36.1\n1046\t      - —\n1047\t    - - Qwen\n1048\t      - dataflow\n1049\t      - 36.8\n1050\t      - '+0.7'\n1051\t    - - Qwen\n1052\t      - embedding\n1053\t      - 37.5\n1054\t      - '+1.4'\n1055\t    - - StarCoder\n1056\t      - BM25\n1057\t      - 28.0\n1058\t      - −2.5\n1059\t    - - StarCoder\n1060\t      - random\n1061\t      - 30.5\n1062\t      - —\n1063\t    - - StarCoder\n1064\t      - dataflow\n1065\t      - 30.1\n1066\t      - −0.4\n1067\t    - - StarCoder\n1068\t      - embedding\n1069\t      - 31.4\n1070\t      - '+0.9'\n1071\t  figures_description:\n1072\t  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy R@1 bar chart (D062 eval) with BM25 in red, annotation arrow\n1073\t    showing BM25→embed gap'\n1074\t  - 'Fig 3b: Neg similarity histograms for 4 strategies showing BM25 occupies distinct\n1075\t    region'\n1076\t  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 best tier 的 crown jewel。将 Claim 1 从 \"argumentative correction\"  升级为\n1077\t    \"empirical demonstration\"：不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy，还实际 复现 harm effect 并展示\n1078\t    true embedding negatives 方向相反。\n1079\t\n1080\t    4-strategy ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示 negative  mining\n1081\t    的 quality spectrum。注意 standard eval 上 embed Δ 较小（+0.3pp Qwen）， 但 D062 query-split\n1082\t    上 embed Δ=+1.4pp——checkpoint selection methodology 揭示 了被 standard eval 掩盖的真实效应。\n1083\t\n1084\t    '\n1085\t- name: Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\n1086\t  plan_id: plan_019\n1087\t  description: 'SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints，\n1088\t    测试 strategy ranking 在 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\n1089\t\n1090\t    '\n1091\t  expected_results:\n1092\t    qwen:\n1093\t      pool_50:\n1094\t        random_R1: 0.57\n1095\t        embedding_R1: 0.573\n1096\t        dataflow_R1: 0.559\n1097\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n1098\t        note: pool=50 与 standard eval (pool=8) anchor 接近但稍低\n1099\t      pool_100:\n1100\t        random_R1: 0.432\n1101\t        embedding_R1: 0.446\n1102\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n1103\t      pool_200:\n1104\t        random_R1: 0.348\n1105\t        embedding_R1: 0.361\n1106\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n1107\t      pool_500:\n1108\t        random_R1: 0.265\n1109\t        embedding_R1: 0.277\n1110\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n1111\t    starcoder:\n1112\t      pool_50:\n1113\t        random_R1: 0.479\n1114\t        embedding_R1: 0.485\n1115\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n1116\t      pool_100:\n1117\t        random_R1: 0.365\n1118\t        embedding_R1: 0.377\n1119\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n1120\t      pool_200:\n1121\t        random_R1: 0.29\n1122\t        embedding_R1: 0.301\n1123\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n1124\t      pool_500:\n1125\t        random_R1: 0.222\n1126\t        embedding_R1: 0.232\n1127\t        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n1128\t    ranking_stable_across_pools: true\n1129\t    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 100\n1130\t    delta_trend: Δ increases from pool=50 to pool=100, then gradually shrinks at larger\n1131\t      pools\n1132\t  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking 在 50→500 全程保持稳定（100% stability）。关键发现：delta 从  pool=50\n1133\t    的 0.3-0.6pp 跃升至 pool=100 的 1.2-1.4pp，然后缓慢缩小到 pool=500 的  1.0-1.2pp。\n1134\t\n1135\t    Pool=50 delta 小是因为标准 eval pool=8 的 ceiling effect 延伸——候选太少， random 已经有较高 baseline。Pool=100\n1136\t    时 distractor 数量足够使 mining 质量差异 充分体现（sweet spot）。Pool>200 时 delta 开始缩小因为大 pool\n1137\t    中 random negatives  偶然包含 \"hard\" negative 的概率增加（base rate effect），部分弥合了 mining\n1138\t    差距。 但核心 signal 不消失——pool=500 仍有 +1.0~1.2pp。\n1139\t\n1140\t    这直接回应 reviewer \"pool=50 unrealistically small\" concern：即使 10x 扩大， strategy ranking\n1141\t    完全不翻转，且 delta 在 realistic pool sizes 反而更大。\n1142\t\n1143\t    '\n1144\t  tables:\n1145\t  - name: 'Table 8: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)'\n1146\t    columns:\n1147\t    - Pool\n1148\t    - Encoder\n1149\t    - random\n1150\t    - embedding\n1151\t    - dataflow\n1152\t    - emb−rand (pp)\n1153\t    - Ranking\n1154\t    rows:\n1155\t    - - 50\n1156\t      - Qwen\n1157\t      - 57.0\n1158\t      - 57.3\n1159\t      - 55.9\n1160\t      - '+0.3'\n1161\t      - E≥R>D\n1162\t    - - 100\n1163\t      - Qwen\n1164\t      - 43.2\n1165\t      - 44.6\n1166\t      - 43.0\n1167\t      - '+1.4'\n1168\t      - E>R≥D\n1169\t    - - 200\n1170\t      - Qwen\n1171\t      - 34.8\n1172\t      - 36.1\n1173\t      - 35.0\n1174\t      - '+1.3'\n1175\t      - E>D>R\n1176\t    - - 500\n1177\t      - Qwen\n1178\t      - 26.5\n1179\t      - 27.7\n1180\t      - 26.2\n1181\t      - '+1.2'\n1182\t      - E>R>D\n1183\t    - - 50\n1184\t      - StarCoder\n1185\t      - 47.9\n1186\t      - 48.5\n1187\t      - 47.2\n1188\t      - '+0.6'\n1189\t      - E>R>D\n1190\t    - - 100\n1191\t      - StarCoder\n1192\t      - 36.5\n1193\t      - 37.7\n1194\t      - 36.2\n1195\t      - '+1.2'\n1196\t      - E>R>D\n1197\t    - - 200\n1198\t      - StarCoder\n1199\t      - 29.0\n1200\t      - 30.1\n1201\t      - 28.8\n1202\t      - '+1.1'\n1203\t      - E>R>D\n1204\t    - - 500\n1205\t      - StarCoder\n1206\t      - 22.2\n1207\t      - 23.2\n1208\t      - 22.0\n1209\t      - '+1.0'\n1210\t      - E>R≈D\n1211\t  figures_description:\n1212\t  - 'Fig 9: Pool size (x-axis, log) vs R@1 (y-axis), 3 strategies overlaid, separate\n1213\t    panels per encoder'\n1214\t  - 'Fig 9b: Delta (embed − random) vs pool size, showing non-monotonic pattern'\n1215\t  analysis: 'Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性关键证据。非单调 pattern（小 pool delta 小 →  medium\n1216\t    pool delta 大 → large pool delta 缩小）提供了 mechanistic insight： mining 的价值在 moderate\n1217\t    difficulty 区间最大（Goldilocks zone）。 100% ranking stability 在全范围保持是 best tier 标志。\n1218\t\n1219\t    '\n1220\t- name: UniXcoder Multi-Seed Validation (3 seeds × 3 strategies)\n1221\t  plan_id: plan_020\n1222\t  description: 'UniXcoder-base (encoder-only, 125M) 3 seeds × 3 strategies。 s42 DONE（null\n1223\t    result, 0.37pp span）。s43 RUNNING（random done, embed running）。 s44 PREPARING。验证\n1224\t    scale boundary condition。\n1225\t\n1226\t    '\n1227\t  expected_results:\n1228\t    s42:\n1229\t      random_R1: 0.5534\n1230\t      embedding_R1: 0.5497\n1231\t      dataflow_R1: 0.551\n1232\t      span_pp: 0.37\n1233\t    s43:\n1234\t      random_R1: 0.577\n1235\t      embedding_R1: 0.575\n1236\t      dataflow_R1: 0.574\n1237\t      span_pp: 0.3\n1238\t    s44:\n1239\t      random_R1: 0.562\n1240\t      embedding_R1: 0.56\n1241\t      dataflow_R1: 0.561\n1242\t      span_pp: 0.2\n1243\t    mean_across_seeds:\n1244\t      random_R1: 0.564\n1245\t      embedding_R1: 0.561\n1246\t      dataflow_R1: 0.562\n1247\t    overall_span_pp: 0.3\n1248\t    max_pairwise_delta_pp: 0.3\n1249\t    all_deltas_nonsignificant: true\n1250\t    bootstrap_ci_all_contain_zero: true\n1251\t    conclusion: 125M encoder-only model saturates regardless of mining strategy\n1252\t  result_rationale: 'UniXcoder (125M params, encoder-only architecture) 在所有 3 seeds\n1253\t    上均显示  null result——3 策略 R@1 span < 0.4pp，远小于 seed variance (~1.4pp)。\n1254\t\n1255\t    原因：125M 模型 representation capacity 不足以利用 harder negatives 的信号。 Neg difficulty\n1256\t    分析显示 UniXcoder 的 margin 分布已高度压缩（与 Qwen 类似的  high pos_sim），但不同于 Qwen（3B, enough\n1257\t    capacity to learn from margin signal）， 125M 模型缺乏参数量来在这个压缩空间中进一步微调区分。\n1258\t\n1259\t    这干净地归因于 model scale 而非 architecture（UniXcoder 是 encoder-only 但 这不是核心因素——125M 即使是\n1260\t    decoder-only 也大概率 saturate）。Paper 中作为  \"effect requires sufficient model capacity\"\n1261\t    的 boundary condition，增强故事 的科学严谨性——不是所有模型都能 benefit from mining。\n1262\t\n1263\t    '\n1264\t  tables:\n1265\t  - name: 'Table 4: UniXcoder-base (125M) — Scale Boundary Condition'\n1266\t    columns:\n1267\t    - Seed\n1268\t    - random\n1269\t    - embedding\n1270\t    - dataflow\n1271\t    - Span (pp)\n1272\t    rows:\n1273\t    - - 42\n1274\t      - 55.34\n1275\t      - 54.97\n1276\t      - 55.1\n1277\t      - 0.37\n1278\t    - - 43\n1279\t      - 57.7\n1280\t      - 57.5\n1281\t      - 57.4\n1282\t      - 0.3\n1283\t    - - 44\n1284\t      - 56.2\n1285\t      - 56.0\n1286\t      - 56.1\n1287\t      - 0.2\n1288\t    - - Mean\n1289\t      - 56.41\n1290\t      - 56.16\n1291\t      - 56.2\n1292\t      - 0.25\n1293\t  figures_description:\n1294\t  - 'Fig S8: UniXcoder 3-strategy comparison across 3 seeds — flat lines within noise'\n1295\t  analysis: '3-seed null result 排除了 \"s42 可能是巧合\" 的 concern。Consistent null across  seeds\n1296\t    + significant effect on 3B models = clean scale boundary at ~125M-3B range。 Paper\n1297\t    可以明确声明：\"mining strategy effects require models above ~1B parameters  to manifest.\"\n1298\t\n1299\t    '\n1300\t- name: Temperature Ablation Reduced (τ = 0.05, 0.2)\n1301\t  plan_id: plan_021\n1302\t  description: 'plan_014 的 reduced 版本：τ ∈ {0.05, 0.2} × random+embedding × Qwen ×\n1303\t    seed 42。 如果 plan_014 (full, 70h) 无法执行，用 plan_021 (15h) 作为 minimum。\n1304\t\n1305\t    '\n1306\t  expected_results:\n1307\t    tau_005:\n1308\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.56\n1309\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.576\n1310\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n1311\t    tau_020:\n1312\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.538\n1313\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.55\n1314\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n1315\t    tau_010_reference:\n1316\t      qwen_random_R1: 0.553\n1317\t      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.567\n1318\t      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n1319\t    ranking_preserved: true\n1320\t    regime_specific: false\n1321\t  result_rationale: '与 plan_014 相同逻辑，仅覆盖 Qwen + random/embedding。如果 τ=0.05 和 τ=0.2  均显示\n1322\t    embedding > random（1.2-1.6pp），且 ranking 不翻转，则 regime-specificity  concern 被关闭。15h\n1323\t    GPU budget 是可接受的 minimum viable ablation。\n1324\t\n1325\t    '\n1326\t  tables:\n1327\t  - name: 'Table S8: Temperature Ablation (Reduced, Qwen only)'\n1328\t    columns:\n1329\t    - τ\n1330\t    - random R@1 (%)\n1331\t    - embedding R@1 (%)\n1332\t    - Δ (pp)\n1333\t    rows:\n1334\t    - - 0.05\n1335\t      - 56.0\n1336\t      - 57.6\n1337\t      - '+1.6'\n1338\t    - - 0.1\n1339\t      - 55.3\n1340\t      - 56.7\n1341\t      - '+1.4'\n1342\t    - - 0.2\n1343\t      - 53.8\n1344\t      - 55.0\n1345\t      - '+1.2'\n1346\t  figures_description: []\n1347\t  analysis: 'Reduced ablation 足以回应 reviewer concern。如果 GPU budget 允许， 扩展到 StarCoder\n1348\t    + dataflow（plan_014 full）提供更完整覆盖。\n1349\t\n1350\t    '\n1351\t- name: D062 Checkpoint Selection Criterion Effect Analysis\n1352\t  plan_id: d062_checkpoint_criterion\n1353\t  description: 'D062 创新方法论贡献：从 2980 val queries 分出 500-query selection set（用于  checkpoint\n1354\t    selection）+ 2480-query held-out evaluation set。分析 checkpoint  选择标准（best_by_val_loss\n1355\t    vs best_by_R@1）对最终性能的影响。\n1356\t\n1357\t    D065 发现：Qwen random_s43 by_R@1=0.504 vs by_val_loss=0.341（+16.3pp）， s42 两标准同一\n1358\t    checkpoint（R@1=0.230）。这一效应远大于 mining strategy effect。\n1359\t\n1360\t    '\n1361\t  expected_results:\n1362\t    qwen_query_split:\n1363\t      random_s42:\n1364\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.23\n1365\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.23\n1366\t        criterion_gap_pp: 0.0\n1367\t        note: 两标准选到同一 checkpoint\n1368\t      random_s43:\n1369\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.341\n1370\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.504\n1371\t        criterion_gap_pp: 16.3\n1372\t        note: 最大 criterion effect，val_loss 选 step 500, R@1 选 step 1500\n1373\t      random_s44:\n1374\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.35\n1375\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.385\n1376\t        criterion_gap_pp: 3.5\n1377\t      embed_s42:\n1378\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.245\n1379\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.265\n1380\t        criterion_gap_pp: 2.0\n1381\t      embed_s43:\n1382\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.365\n1383\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.518\n1384\t        criterion_gap_pp: 15.3\n1385\t      embed_s44:\n1386\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.37\n1387\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.395\n1388\t        criterion_gap_pp: 2.5\n1389\t      dataflow_s43:\n1390\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.355\n1391\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.51\n1392\t        criterion_gap_pp: 15.5\n1393\t    starcoder_query_split:\n1394\t      random_s42:\n1395\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.28\n1396\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.31\n1397\t        criterion_gap_pp: 3.0\n1398\t      random_s43:\n1399\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.295\n1400\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.42\n1401\t        criterion_gap_pp: 12.5\n1402\t      embed_s42:\n1403\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.27\n1404\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.305\n1405\t        criterion_gap_pp: 3.5\n1406\t      embed_s43:\n1407\t        by_val_loss_R1: 0.3\n1408\t        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.435\n1409\t        criterion_gap_pp: 13.5\n1410\t    summary_statistics:\n1411\t      max_criterion_effect_pp: 16.3\n1412\t      mean_criterion_effect_pp: 8.5\n1413\t      median_criterion_effect_pp: 3.5\n1414\t      criterion_effect_nonzero_rate: 0.72\n1415\t      mining_strategy_mean_effect_pp: 1.2\n1416\t      criterion_to_mining_ratio: 7.1\n1417\t    replicates_across_encoders: true\n1418\t    replicates_across_seeds: true\n1419\t  result_rationale: 'D062 query-split evaluation 揭示了一个被忽视的方法论问题：标准 contrastive  retrieval\n1420\t    评估中，checkpoint 是在 val set 上选择的，然后在 SAME val set 上 报告 R@1——这导致 checkpoint selection\n1421\t    过拟合 val queries。\n1422\t\n1423\t    Query-split 方法将 val queries 分为 selection set (500) 和 evaluation set  (2480)。在\n1424\t    held-out evaluation 上，best_by_val_loss 与 best_by_R@1 的差距 高达 16.3pp（Qwen s43），因为：\n1425\t\n1426\t    (1) val_loss 在 step 500 最低——此时模型刚开始训练，泛化最好但 ranking 能力不足； (2) R@1 在 step 1500\n1427\t    最高——此时模型已学会 ranking 但开始 overfit； (3) 在 held-out queries 上，step 1500 的 ranking\n1428\t    能力泛化良好（0.504）， 而 step 500 的 ranking 能力不足（0.341）。\n1429\t\n1430\t    The criterion effect (+16.3pp max, 8.5pp mean) >> mining strategy effect (~1.2pp)，\n1431\t    ratio 7:1。这意味着社区对 mining strategy 效果的评估被 checkpoint selection  noise 掩盖。\n1432\t\n1433\t    StarCoder 上 effect 稍小（max 13.5pp）但方向一致——pattern replicates。\n1434\t\n1435\t    这是论文独立方法论贡献： - 发现：standard eval 系统性高估所有策略的绝对 R@1（因为 checkpoint overfit） - 发现：standard\n1436\t    eval 系统性低估策略间差异（因为 criterion noise 掩盖 signal） - 推荐：use query-split + R@1 criterion\n1437\t    for checkpoint selection\n1438\t\n1439\t    '\n1440\t  tables:\n1441\t  - name: 'Table 9: Checkpoint Criterion Effect (D062 Query-Split, Qwen)'\n1442\t    columns:\n1443\t    - Strategy\n1444\t    - Seed\n1445\t    - by val_loss R@1\n1446\t    - by R@1 R@1\n1447\t    - Gap (pp)\n1448\t    rows:\n1449\t    - - random\n1450\t      - 42\n1451\t      - 0.23\n1452\t      - 0.23\n1453\t      - '0.0'\n1454\t    - - random\n1455\t      - 43\n1456\t      - 0.341\n1457\t      - 0.504\n1458\t      - '+16.3'\n1459\t    - - random\n1460\t      - 44\n1461\t      - 0.35\n1462\t      - 0.385\n1463\t      - '+3.5'\n1464\t    - - embedding\n1465\t      - 42\n1466\t      - 0.245\n1467\t      - 0.265\n1468\t      - '+2.0'\n1469\t    - - embedding\n1470\t      - 43\n1471\t      - 0.365\n1472\t      - 0.518\n1473\t      - '+15.3'\n1474\t    - - embedding\n1475\t      - 44\n1476\t      - 0.37\n1477\t      - 0.395\n1478\t      - '+2.5'\n1479\t    - - dataflow\n1480\t      - 43\n1481\t      - 0.355\n1482\t      - 0.51\n1483\t      - '+15.5'\n1484\t  - name: 'Table 9b: Criterion Effect Summary'\n1485\t    columns:\n1486\t    - Statistic\n1487\t    - Value\n1488\t    rows:\n1489\t    - - Max criterion effect\n1490\t      - +16.3pp\n1491\t    - - Mean criterion effect\n1492\t      - +8.5pp\n1493\t    - - Mean mining strategy effect\n1494\t      - +1.2pp\n1495\t    - - Criterion-to-mining ratio\n1496\t      - 7.1×\n1497\t    - - Runs with >5pp criterion effect\n1498\t      - 3/14 (21%)\n1499\t    - - Replicates across encoders\n1500\t      - 'Yes'\n1501\t  figures_description:\n1502\t  - 'Fig 2: Criterion effect scatter plot — each point is one run, x=by_val_loss R@1,\n1503\t    y=by_R@1 R@1, diagonal line shows equality'\n1504\t  - 'Fig 2b: Training trajectory for s43 showing val_loss/R@1 divergence annotated\n1505\t    with criterion effect'\n1506\t  analysis: 'Checkpoint criterion effect 是 D062 论文最意外也最有影响力的发现。\n1507\t\n1508\t    +16.3pp >> +1.2pp (mining) 意味着： (1) 论文不仅展示 \"mining helps\" 还展示 \"how to properly\n1509\t    evaluate whether mining helps\" (2) 解释了为什么文献中 mining strategy delta 通常很小——standard\n1510\t    eval 掩盖了 signal (3) 提供了 evaluation protocol 改进建议，对整个 contrastive retrieval 社区有价值\n1511\t\n1512\t    s43 的 16.3pp 出现在 val_loss 和 R@1 最严重分歧时——val_loss 选择了训练最早期 的 checkpoint（泛化好但 ranking\n1513\t    弱），R@1 选择了训练中期的 checkpoint（ranking  最优但即将 overfit）。只有 query-split 方法才能在 held-out\n1514\t    上正确评判这一差异。\n1515\t\n1516\t    这一发现使论文从 \"mining strategy comparison\" 升级为 \"evaluation methodology +  mining strategy\n1517\t    comparison\"——双重贡献，EMNLP Main 更强。'\n1518\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"98678e1d-9307-4b37-b78e-c6727fde8087","uuid":"e479d64a-d86f-4ca6-851f-729b0431de31","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:02:27.481Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_5/projects/structfuse-context/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T150348/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Framing B 完全成立：Paper = systematic mining study + methodological\n  contribution。\n\n  Standard eval 上 embed Δ 较小（Qwen ~+0.4pp, StarCoder ~+0.6pp），但 D062 query-split  evaluation\n  揭示标准评估因 checkpoint 过拟合掩盖了真实效应——held-out evaluation 上 embed Δ  恢复至 Qwen +1.4pp, StarCoder\n  +0.9pp（均在 best 档预设范围内）。这一发现本身就是方法论贡献： checkpoint selection criterion effect (+16.3pp\n  max) > mining strategy effect (~1pp)， 说明社区低估了 mining 效果是因为评估方法论缺陷。\n\n  BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm（Δ ≤ -1.5pp），empirically 关闭 CoCoHaNeRe 修正论证。 UniXcoder\n  3-seed null result 干净地归因于 125M scale boundary condition。 RepoBench-R 替代 SWE-bench\n  作为 held-out external validation，CIs non-overlapping。\n\n  3 claims 原样成立：Claim 1 (embed mining reliable) + Claim 2 (exploratory representation  geometry\n  interaction) + 额外贡献 (checkpoint criterion methodology)。EMNLP Main 强投。\n\n  M2 anchors — Standard eval: Qwen random=0.570, embed=0.573, SC random=0.479, embed=0.485。\n  D062 query-split: Qwen random=0.361, embed=0.375, SC random=0.305, embed=0.314。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: M3a SWE-bench Lite E2E — OOD Limitation Disclosure\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '3 strategies × best Qwen checkpoint on SWE-bench Lite 300 instances。\n    实际已完成（random_s42, 100 instances + BM25 baseline 300）。结果为 OOD 泛化失败， 在论文中作为 limitation\n    呈现而非贡献。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    random_s42_100:\n      R_at_1: 0.04\n      R_at_5: 0.11\n      R_at_10: 0.14\n      R_at_20: 0.16\n      MRR: 0.0698\n    bm25_baseline_300:\n      R_at_1: 0.2733\n      R_at_5: 0.4667\n      R_at_10: 0.55\n    neural_vs_bm25_gap_R1_pp: -23.3\n    status: DONE_FAILED\n    director_decision: 放弃 SWE-bench 作为论文贡献，外部验证改用 RepoBench-R\n  result_rationale: 'R@1=0.04 vs BM25=0.2733 表明 contrastive retriever 在 OOD 跨 repo\n    场景完全失败。 根因：SWE-smith 训练数据是 intra-repo 检索（query 与 candidates 来自同一 repo）， 而 SWE-bench\n    是 cross-repo 设置（模型未见过的 repo）。Contrastive fine-tuning在小 pool  内 intra-repo 检索上过拟合，丧失了\n    pretrained encoder 的 cross-repo 泛化能力。 BM25 因为是 lexical matching（不依赖 learned representations）所以不受此影响。\n\n    在 best tier 下，这一失败被 strategically 利用：(1) 诚实报告增强论文可信度， (2) 明确 scope boundary \"our\n    results apply to intra-repo retrieval settings\"， (3) 激发 future work 方向 \"bridging\n    the intra/cross-repo gap\"。 RepoBench-R 替代作为 held-out evaluation（仍是 cross-file\n    但 repo-aware 设置）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S4: SWE-bench OOD Evaluation (Limitation)'\n    columns:\n    - Retriever\n    - R@1\n    - R@5\n    - R@10\n    - MRR\n    - N\n    rows:\n    - - BM25 (reference)\n      - 0.273\n      - 0.467\n      - 0.55\n      - 0.36\n      - 300\n    - - StructFuse-random\n      - 0.04\n      - 0.11\n      - 0.14\n      - 0.07\n      - 100\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S7: SWE-bench R@K curve showing neural retriever collapse below BM25 at all\n    K'\n  analysis: 'SWE-bench failure 在 best tier 下反而加强了论文：它划定了清晰的 scope boundary， 展示了作者的自我审视能力。Reviewer\n    concern \"no downstream eval\" 由 RepoBench-R 回应， SWE-bench 失败则作为 honest limitation\n    处理，1-2 段落放在 Limitations section。\n\n    '\n- name: RepoBench-R Cross-File Retrieval with 3-Seed Bootstrap CIs\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'RepoBench-R test_easy (pool ~6) 和 test_hard (pool ~18) 上评估 3 seeds\n    ×  3 strategies × 2 encoders（Qwen, StarCoder）。报告 R@1 均值 + 95% bootstrap CI。 这是\n    SWE-bench 失败后的替代 held-out external validation。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.62\n      random_R1_ci:\n      - 0.615\n      - 0.625\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.632\n      embedding_R1_ci:\n      - 0.626\n      - 0.638\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.626\n      dataflow_R1_ci:\n      - 0.62\n      - 0.632\n      bm25_R1_mean: 0.601\n      bm25_R1_ci:\n      - 0.595\n      - 0.607\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -1.9\n    qwen_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.842\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.851\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.847\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n    starcoder_test_hard:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.571\n      random_R1_ci:\n      - 0.565\n      - 0.577\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.579\n      embedding_R1_ci:\n      - 0.573\n      - 0.585\n      dataflow_R1_mean: 0.568\n      dataflow_R1_ci:\n      - 0.562\n      - 0.574\n      bm25_R1_mean: 0.553\n      bm25_R1_ci:\n      - 0.547\n      - 0.559\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -1.8\n    starcoder_test_easy:\n      random_R1_mean: 0.81\n      embedding_R1_mean: 0.816\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n    repobench_embed_vs_random_avg_pp: 1.0\n    CI_non_overlapping_embed_vs_random: true\n    bootstrap_N: 10000\n  result_rationale: 'RepoBench-R 是 cross-file code completion 任务，与 SWE-smith (bug-fix\n    retrieval)  领域不同但任务结构相似（从 repo 内候选文件中检索正确文件）。Pool=18 (test_hard) 提供 足够的 distractor\n    使 mining 质量差异体现。\n\n    Embedding mining 在 test_hard 上持续帮助两个 encoder（Qwen +1.2pp, StarCoder +0.8pp）， 因为\n    harder negatives 训练使 encoder 更善于区分 \"semantically similar but functionally  distinct\"\n    文件——这一能力跨任务泛化。CIs non-overlapping 因为 8K test instances 提供 足够的统计功效，即使只有 3 seeds，instance-level\n    bootstrap 也能给出 tight CIs。\n\n    BM25 negatives 在 RepoBench-R 上同样 harm（-1.8 to -1.9pp），与 SWE-smith 一致， 说明 BM25\n    harm 不是 benchmark-specific artifact 而是 strategy 固有问题。\n\n    Test_easy (pool=6) 上 delta 压缩至 0.6-0.9pp 是预期的 ceiling effect—— 6 candidates 中选对\n    1 个的 baseline 已经很高。\n\n    Dataflow 在 Qwen test_hard 上 +0.6pp 但 CI 与 random 接近重叠， StarCoder 上 -0.3pp（CI 含零）——与\n    SWE-smith encoder-strategy interaction 一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: RepoBench-R Results (test_hard, pool≈18)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - BM25\n      - 60.1\n      - '[59.5, 60.7]'\n      - '-1.9'\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 62.0\n      - '[61.5, 62.5]'\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 62.6\n      - '[62.0, 63.2]'\n      - '+0.6'\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 63.2\n      - '[62.6, 63.8]'\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - BM25\n      - 55.3\n      - '[54.7, 55.9]'\n      - '-1.8'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 57.1\n      - '[56.5, 57.7]'\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 56.8\n      - '[56.2, 57.4]'\n      - '-0.3'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 57.9\n      - '[57.3, 58.5]'\n      - '+0.8'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: RepoBench-R R@1 grouped bar chart (2 encoders × 4 strategies) with CI\n    whiskers'\n  - 'Fig 5b: test_easy vs test_hard side-by-side, showing ceiling compression'\n  analysis: 'Cross-benchmark 一致性是 best tier 核心证据：embedding mining 在 SWE-smith 和  RepoBench-R\n    上均显著提升两个 encoder，BM25 均 harm。这排除了 \"单 benchmark artifact\"  reviewer concern。Strategy\n    ranking BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 完美保持。 test_easy ceiling effect 间接验证了\n    pool size 对效果幅度的调节作用（与 plan_019 互补）。\n\n    '\n- name: Stratified Analysis with 5 Strata (D062 Query-Split Evaluation)\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: '5 层分层分析：repo size / pool size / query-positive similarity /  structural\n    data availability (90% with m1_reextract_v2 vs 10% remaining errors) /  neg_difficulty\n    quartile。使用 M2 best checkpoints 在 D062 query-split held-out  evaluation 上重新评估。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    stratum_structural_available:\n      with_dataflow_90pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.8\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n        starcoder_dataflow_minus_random_pp: -0.2\n        n_instances: ~13000\n        note: m1_reextract_v2 提升 coverage 从 34% 到 90%\n      no_dataflow_10pct:\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.1\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n        n_instances: ~1400\n    stratum_neg_difficulty_quartile:\n      Q1_easiest:\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.2\n      Q2:\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.5\n      Q3:\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 1.7\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n      Q4_hardest:\n        qwen_embed_minus_random_pp: 2.3\n        qwen_dataflow_minus_random_pp: 1.5\n    stratum_repo_size:\n      small_lt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 2.0\n        n: ~500\n      medium_50_200:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.6\n        n: ~4100\n      large_200_500:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.3\n        n: ~5500\n      xlarge_500plus:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.0\n        n: ~5100\n    stratum_pool_size:\n      pool_lt20:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 0.7\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.2\n      pool_20_50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.5\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.6\n      pool_gt50:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.9\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.9\n    stratum_query_pos_sim:\n      high_sim_gt095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.8\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 1.2\n      medium_sim_085_095:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 1.3\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.5\n      low_sim_lt085:\n        embedding_delta_pp: 0.8\n        dataflow_delta_pp: 0.1\n  result_rationale: 'm1_reextract_v2 将 structural data rate 从 34% 提升到 90%，彻底改变了 structural  stratum\n    分析。90% stratum 上 dataflow Δ=+0.8pp（显著）因为绝大部分 instance 现在 获得真实 dataflow-disconnected\n    negatives。10% remaining errors 上 dataflow 退化为  random（Δ≈0），因为缺乏结构数据意味着 fallback\n    策略无差异。\n\n    Neg difficulty Q4（最难 quartile）embed Δ=+2.3pp 是 overall 的 ~1.6 倍——越难的  instance（margin\n    最小）从 harder negatives 获益最多，这是 representation saturation  理论的直接预测。Q1（最易）Δ 最小（0.6pp）因为\n    random negatives 已足够区分。\n\n    Repo size 上 small repo Δ 最大（2.0pp）因为小 repo candidate pool 集中，mining  质量差异更容易体现。Pool\n    size > 50 时 delta 增大到 1.9pp，说明 mining 在更大搜索 空间下更有价值。\n\n    Query-positive similarity 分层显示 high sim（>0.95）时 delta 最大，与 Qwen  saturation 分析一致——高相似度区域是\n    embedding mining 最有价值的场景。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Stratified Embed-Random Δ by Neg Difficulty Quartile (Qwen, D062\n      eval)'\n    columns:\n    - Quartile\n    - margin_mean\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Q1 (easiest)\n      - 0.135\n      - '+0.6'\n      - '+0.2'\n    - - Q2\n      - 0.072\n      - '+1.1'\n      - '+0.5'\n    - - Q3\n      - 0.028\n      - '+1.7'\n      - '+0.9'\n    - - Q4 (hardest)\n      - 0.007\n      - '+2.3'\n      - '+1.5'\n  - name: 'Table 6b: Stratified by Structural Data Availability (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Stratum\n    - N\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - df−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - With dataflow (90%)\n      - ~13K\n      - '+1.3'\n      - '+0.8'\n    - - No dataflow (10%)\n      - ~1.4K\n      - '+1.4'\n      - '+0.1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: Neg difficulty quartile × strategy interaction line plot'\n  - 'Fig 7: Heatmap — R@1 delta (strategy × stratum), separate panels for Qwen and\n    StarCoder'\n  analysis: 'Neg difficulty quartile 分析是 best tier 最强 mechanistic 证据。Q4 的 2.3pp  embed\n    delta 是 overall 1.4pp 的 1.6 倍——直接验证 \"harder instances benefit more  from harder\n    negatives\" 的理论预测。Structural availability 分析从 34%→90% coverage  升级后说服力大增——90% stratum\n    的 dataflow Δ=+0.8pp 是 clean signal。 Confound analysis（rich-dataflow 99.3% 在 large/xlarge\n    repo）仍需控制 repo size  来隔离 dataflow richness 独立效应。\n\n    '\n- name: Call-Graph Hop Depth Ablation (1/2/3-hop)\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: '比较 1-hop / 2-hop / 3-hop call-graph bounding 对 dataflow negative 质量影响。\n    Qwen encoder, 1 seed, SWE-smith validation。使用 m1_reextract_v2 数据（90% coverage）。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    hop_1:\n      R1: 0.548\n      connected_coverage_pct: 15.2\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 21.4\n    hop_2:\n      R1: 0.558\n      connected_coverage_pct: 45.8\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 38.6\n    hop_3:\n      R1: 0.553\n      connected_coverage_pct: 72.1\n      negatives_per_query_mean: 55.3\n    optimal_hop: 2\n    hop2_minus_hop1_pp: 1.0\n    hop3_minus_hop2_pp: -0.5\n  result_rationale: 'm1_reextract_v2 90% coverage 下，各 hop depth 的 connected coverage\n    均高于原 34%。 2-hop 最优因为：(1) 1-hop 仅覆盖 15.2% instances（直接 caller/callee），大部分 instance  没有足够\n    connected nodes 定义 meaningful disconnection，退化为 random；(2) 3-hop  coverage 72.1%\n    过高，\"disconnected\" 定义过窄——许多语义相关但 3-hop 可达的文件被错误排除 在 negative pool 外；(3) 2-hop coverage\n    45.8%（近一半 instance 有 meaningful  structural signal）平衡了 signal quality 和 coverage。\n\n    2-hop 对应 inter-procedural 语义：直接 caller/callee + 一层间接调用。 这是 principled 选择而非纯 empirical\n    tuning。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S1: Hop Depth Ablation (Qwen, dataflow strategy)'\n    columns:\n    - Hops\n    - Coverage (%)\n    - Neg/query\n    - R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs 2-hop (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1\n      - 15.2\n      - 21.4\n      - 54.8\n      - '-1.0'\n    - - 2\n      - 45.8\n      - 38.6\n      - 55.8\n      - —\n    - - 3\n      - 72.1\n      - 55.3\n      - 55.3\n      - '-0.5'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S1: Hop depth vs R@1 line plot with coverage % on secondary y-axis'\n  analysis: 'Inverted-U pattern（1-hop < 2-hop > 3-hop）支持 \"optimal structural granularity\"  narrative。2-hop\n    + m1_reextract_v2 (90% coverage) 的组合是论文推荐配置。\n\n    '\n- name: Training Data Size Scaling (1K/3K/5K instances)\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: '固定 Qwen encoder + 3 strategies，训练数据从 1K / 3K / 5K instances 增长， 观察\n    R@1 变化和策略排名稳定性。1 seed per size。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    size_1K:\n      random_R1: 0.515\n      embedding_R1: 0.524\n      dataflow_R1: 0.518\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.9\n      seed_std: 0.018\n    size_3K:\n      random_R1: 0.54\n      embedding_R1: 0.552\n      dataflow_R1: 0.545\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      seed_std: 0.012\n    size_5K:\n      random_R1: 0.553\n      embedding_R1: 0.567\n      dataflow_R1: 0.559\n      embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n      seed_std: 0.009\n    ranking_stable: true\n    monotonic_improvement: true\n  result_rationale: '策略排名在 3 个尺度上保持一致（embedding > dataflow > random），delta 幅度随数据量\n    增大而增大（1K: 0.9pp → 5K: 1.4pp）。更大训练集提供更多 diverse negatives，mining  策略差异更充分体现。1K\n    时 seed variance 较大（1.8pp std）因为 negative 多样性不足， 个别 seed 的采样偶然性影响结果。5K 时 variance\n    收敛至 0.9pp。 No diminishing returns at 5K 暗示进一步 scaling 可能有益。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Data Size Scaling (Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Size\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - σ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 1K\n      - 51.5\n      - 52.4\n      - 51.8\n      - '+0.9'\n      - 1.8\n    - - 3K\n      - 54.0\n      - 55.2\n      - 54.5\n      - '+1.2'\n      - 1.2\n    - - 5K\n      - 55.3\n      - 56.7\n      - 55.9\n      - '+1.4'\n      - 0.9\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S2: R@1 vs training size for 3 strategies with shaded variance bands'\n  analysis: 'Stable ranking + growing delta 说明 mining effect 不是 small-data artifact。\n    5K 未达 diminishing returns，当前 delta 是下界不是上界——回应 \"effect marginal\" concern。\n\n    '\n- name: Fusion Head Ablation (mining vs inference-time features)\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '比较 embedding-only / structural-features-only / combined fusion head。\n    隔离 training-time mining 价值与 inference-time feature injection。 Qwen + StarCoder,\n    best embedding checkpoint。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    embedding_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.567\n      starcoder_R1: 0.485\n    structural_features_only:\n      qwen_R1: 0.501\n      starcoder_R1: 0.422\n    combined_fusion:\n      qwen_R1: 0.564\n      starcoder_R1: 0.483\n    embedding_only_minus_combined_pp: 0.3\n    embedding_only_minus_structural_only_pp: 6.6\n    conclusion: mining >> fusion; structural features at inference add noise\n  result_rationale: 'Embedding-only（mining 训练，inference 不注入结构特征）表现最好或 tied with combined。\n    Combined 略低 0.3pp 因为 inference-time structural features 引入不精确信号—— 即使 m1_reextract_v2\n    coverage 90%，仍有 10% instance 收到 zero-vector structural  features 引入 noise。\n\n    Structural-features-only（不用 mining，仅 inference 时注入）远低于 embedding-only （-6.6pp\n    Qwen），证明核心价值在 training-time negative mining 而非 inference-time  feature engineering。Paper\n    可据此明确：StructFuse 的贡献是 mining strategy，不是 fusion。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S3: Fusion Head Ablation'\n    columns:\n    - Configuration\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    rows:\n    - - embedding-only (ours)\n      - 56.7\n      - 48.5\n    - - structural-features-only\n      - 50.1\n      - 42.2\n    - - combined fusion\n      - 56.4\n      - 48.3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S3: Ablation bar chart comparing 3 fusion configurations'\n  analysis: 'Mining（间接 structural signal）> fusion（直接 structural features）。 原因：mining\n    让 encoder 自己学习 structure-relevant representations， 直接注入 features 绕过了学习过程且引入 coverage\n    noise。强化论文 narrative。\n\n    '\n- name: Dataflow-Distance Weighted vs Binary Negatives\n  plan_id: plan_010\n  description: '比较 binary connected/disconnected 与 dataflow-distance weighted negative\n    sampling。 Weighted: disconnected 且 hop-distance 更远的文件赋予更高采样概率。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    binary_qwen_R1: 0.559\n    weighted_qwen_R1: 0.561\n    binary_starcoder_R1: 0.472\n    weighted_starcoder_R1: 0.473\n    weighted_minus_binary_qwen_pp: 0.2\n    weighted_minus_binary_starcoder_pp: 0.1\n    significant: false\n  result_rationale: 'Weighted 仅微弱提升 +0.1~0.2pp（不显著）。Binary disconnected/connected\n    已捕获 最关键的 structural distinction——\"是否在调用链上\"。进一步按 hop distance 加权引入的 额外信号被 noise\n    抵消：距离更远 ≠ 更好 negative（utility 文件可能 hop=∞ 但也是  trivial negative）。Binary 的简洁性是优势——fewer\n    hyperparameters, same effect。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S5: Weighted vs Binary Dataflow Negatives'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Qwen R@1 (%)\n    - StarCoder R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs Binary (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Binary (default)\n      - 55.9\n      - 47.2\n      - —\n    - - Distance-weighted\n      - 56.1\n      - 47.3\n      - +0.2 / +0.1\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Binary sufficient — weighted complexity not justified。 论文 ablation section\n    用一句话报告，强化 \"simple binary is the key insight\"。\n\n    '\n- name: SWE-smith Retrieval Failure Analysis (repurposed from SWE-bench)\n  plan_id: plan_011\n  description: '原计划分析 SWE-bench 失败案例。SWE-bench 已失败（R@1=0.04, OOD），改为分析 SWE-smith validation\n    上 random retriever 失败的 50 个案例，分类失败原因， 标注 embedding/dataflow mining 能否帮助。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_analyzed: 50\n    source: SWE-smith validation set (intra-repo setting)\n    category_breakdown:\n      similar_but_wrong_file: 19\n      distant_but_correct_file: 12\n      pool_saturation_all_similar: 9\n      query_ambiguity: 6\n      singleton_gold_no_candidates: 4\n    mining_would_help:\n      embedding_helps: 17\n      dataflow_helps: 8\n      neither_helps: 25\n    embedding_help_rate: 0.34\n    dataflow_additional_help_rate: 0.16\n  result_rationale: '50 个失败中 19 个是 \"similar but wrong\"——检索到与 gold 高文本相似但非同一 call chain  的文件。Embedding\n    mining 训练可帮助其中 17 个（让 encoder 学会区分高相似度区域内的细微差异）。 Dataflow 额外帮助 8 个涉及跨模块调用链的案例（embedding\n    mining 无法捕获的 structural  dependencies）。25 个 \"neither helps\" 主要是 pool saturation（候选全部高度相似）和  query\n    ambiguity（issue 描述模糊无法定位）。\n\n    34% embedding help rate 与 observed 1.0-1.4pp delta 一致： 如果 34% 的失败中有一部分被修正，对应 ~1-2pp\n    总体提升。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S6: Failure Category Breakdown (SWE-smith)'\n    columns:\n    - Category\n    - Count\n    - '% of 50'\n    - Mining Helps?\n    rows:\n    - - Similar but wrong file\n      - 19\n      - 38\n      - 17/19 (embed)\n    - - Distant correct file\n      - 12\n      - 24\n      - 8/12 (dataflow)\n    - - Pool saturation\n      - 9\n      - 18\n      - 2/9 (partial)\n    - - Query ambiguity\n      - 6\n      - 12\n      - 0/6\n    - - Singleton gold\n      - 4\n      - 8\n      - 0/4\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: Failure category pie chart with mining-could-help overlay'\n  analysis: 'Failure analysis 将抽象 delta 转化为具体机制。\"Similar but wrong\" 是最大失败类别 且最易被 embedding\n    mining 修正——直接支持 Claim 1 的 mechanistic explanation。\n\n    '\n- name: Qualitative Examples (5-8 cases from SWE-smith)\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: '从 SWE-smith 中选取 5-8 个 embedding/dataflow mining 改变检索结果的典型案例。 （原依赖\n    SWE-bench，现改用 SWE-smith internal data。）\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_examples: 7\n    example_categories:\n      caller_callee_confusion: 3\n      utility_file_distraction: 2\n      cross_module_import_chain: 1\n      test_vs_source: 1\n    illustrative_example:\n      repo: sample-python-project\n      query: issue about incorrect cache invalidation\n      random_top1: cache/utils.py (lexical match on 'cache')\n      embedding_top1: cache/backend.py (semantically similar, shares embedding cluster)\n      dataflow_top1: cache/backend.py + storage/driver.py (caller chain)\n      gold: cache/backend.py\n  result_rationale: '7 个案例覆盖 4 个失败模式。Caller-callee confusion（3 个）最常见——文本相似的  wrapper\n    函数 vs 实际实现是 code retrieval 的核心挑战。案例具体展示了  \"lexical similarity ≠ structural relevance\"，使抽象的\n    representation geometry  论证变得具体可感。\n\n    '\n  tables: []\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Side-by-side retrieval ranking for 3 representative cases with dependency\n    graph overlay'\n  analysis: 'Qualitative examples 是论文 \"aha moment\"——即使对统计显著性持怀疑态度的 reviewer， 也能通过具体案例理解\n    mining 策略的作用机制。\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation τ ∈ {0.05, 0.1, 0.2} (Full)\n  plan_id: plan_014\n  description: '3 temperatures × 3 strategies × 2 encoders, 1 seed each。 测试 strategy\n    ranking 是否 temperature-regime-specific。 （plan_021 为 reduced 版本；如果时间足够，运行 full\n    plan_014。）\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_005:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.56\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.576\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.568\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.487\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.497\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n    tau_010:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.553\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.567\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.559\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.479\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.485\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n    tau_020:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.538\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.55\n      qwen_dataflow_R1: 0.544\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      starcoder_random_R1: 0.465\n      starcoder_embedding_R1: 0.472\n      starcoder_embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.7\n    ranking_preserved_across_tau: true\n    optimal_tau: 0.05\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking（embedding > dataflow > random for Qwen; embedding\n    > random ≈  dataflow for StarCoder）在三个 τ 下保持一致。τ=0.05 绝对性能最高——sharper temperature  使\n    contrastive loss 更有效地放大相似度差异。τ=0.2 下 delta 缩小（1.2pp vs 1.4pp  for Qwen）——softer\n    temperature 压缩所有 similarity 到窄范围，减弱 hard vs easy  negatives 的梯度差异。\n\n    关键结论：findings 不是 temperature-regime-specific。直接回应 median reviewer 的  \"τ=0.05 unusually\n    low\" concern。τ=0.1 作为 paper default（literature convention）， τ=0.05 作为 alternative\n    best configuration 在 ablation 报告。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Temperature Ablation (R@1 %)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - Qwen\n      - 56.0\n      - 57.6\n      - 56.8\n      - '+1.6'\n    - - 0.05\n      - StarCoder\n      - 48.7\n      - 49.7\n      - 48.5\n      - '+1.0'\n    - - 0.1\n      - Qwen\n      - 55.3\n      - 56.7\n      - 55.9\n      - '+1.4'\n    - - 0.1\n      - StarCoder\n      - 47.9\n      - 48.5\n      - 47.4\n      - '+0.6'\n    - - 0.2\n      - Qwen\n      - 53.8\n      - 55.0\n      - 54.4\n      - '+1.2'\n    - - 0.2\n      - StarCoder\n      - 46.5\n      - 47.2\n      - 46.3\n      - '+0.7'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S5: Temperature × strategy interaction plot, separate panels per encoder'\n  analysis: 'Ranking stability across τ 是关键 robustness 证据。τ=0.2 delta 缩小但不翻转—— mining\n    quality 的价值在不同 loss sharpness 下都存在。\n\n    '\n- name: Dynamic vs Static Embedding Mining\n  plan_id: plan_015\n  description: 'Dynamic: 每 epoch 用当前 encoder 重新挖 embedding negatives。 Static: 仅用 pretrained\n    encoder 挖一次（当前做法）。 Qwen + StarCoder, 1 seed each。Phase 2 (GPU) QUEUED。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_static_R1: 0.567\n    qwen_dynamic_R1: 0.569\n    qwen_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.2\n    starcoder_static_R1: 0.485\n    starcoder_dynamic_R1: 0.486\n    starcoder_dynamic_minus_static_pp: 0.1\n    dynamic_significant: false\n    curriculum_confound_ruled_out: true\n  result_rationale: 'Dynamic 仅微弱提升 +0.1~0.2pp（不显著），因为 LoRA rank 16 fine-tuning 只轻微\n    改变 embedding space——pretrained encoder 的 nearest neighbors 训练后大部分不变。 这排除了 \"static\n    mining 优势来自 curriculum effect (early hard → stale negatives)\"  的 confound。\n\n    对 Claim 2 重要：mining strategy 的选择（what to mine）比 mining schedule  （when to mine）更关键。Dynamic\n    的 compute overhead（每 epoch 重新 encode + kNN） not justified——强化 \"zero-cost\" framing。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S7: Static vs Dynamic Embedding Mining'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Static R@1 (%)\n    - Dynamic R@1 (%)\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - 56.7\n      - 56.9\n      - '+0.2'\n      - 0.44\n    - - StarCoder\n      - 48.5\n      - 48.6\n      - '+0.1'\n      - 0.56\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S6: Learning curves for static vs dynamic mining, overlaid'\n  analysis: 'Static ≈ dynamic 是 clean negative result。强化 \"mine once from pretrained,  no\n    re-mining needed\" 的 practitioner recommendation。\n\n    '\n- name: Bootstrap CIs for M2 Main Results + RepoBench-R\n  plan_id: plan_016\n  description: '原为 SWE-bench CIs，现 repurpose 为 M2 main results (D062 query-split eval)  和\n    RepoBench-R 的 paired bootstrap 95% CIs。10K resamples。 统一统计框架覆盖所有 pairwise comparisons。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    m2_query_split_eval:\n      qwen_embed_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: 1.4\n        ci_95:\n        - 0.5\n        - 2.3\n        p_value: 0.012\n        significant: true\n      starcoder_embed_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: 0.9\n        ci_95:\n        - 0.1\n        - 1.7\n        p_value: 0.038\n        significant: true\n      qwen_bm25_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: -2.9\n        ci_95:\n        - -4.1\n        - -1.7\n        p_value: 0.001\n        significant: true\n      starcoder_bm25_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: -2.5\n        ci_95:\n        - -3.8\n        - -1.2\n        p_value: 0.003\n        significant: true\n      qwen_dataflow_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: 0.7\n        ci_95:\n        - -0.2\n        - 1.6\n        p_value: 0.089\n        significant: false\n    repobench_r_test_hard:\n      qwen_embed_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: 1.2\n        ci_95:\n        - 0.6\n        - 1.8\n        p_value: 0.002\n        significant: true\n      starcoder_embed_minus_random:\n        delta_pp: 0.8\n        ci_95:\n        - 0.2\n        - 1.4\n        p_value: 0.014\n        significant: true\n    bootstrap_n: 10000\n    all_embed_vs_random_exclude_zero: true\n    all_bm25_vs_random_exclude_zero: true\n  result_rationale: 'D062 query-split eval 上 embed vs random CI 下界 > 0 for both encoders，\n    confirming statistical significance。BM25 vs random CI 上界 < 0，confirming harm。\n    Dataflow vs random 在 Qwen 上 borderline（p=0.089, CI 含零）——consistent with  Claim\n    2 的 \"exploratory/conditional\" framing。\n\n    RepoBench-R CIs 更 tight（8K test instances 提供更大统计功效），两个 encoder  embed vs random\n    均显著。Cross-benchmark significance 是 Claim 1 的 statistical  closure。\n\n    3 seeds 的 seed-level variance 通过 instance-level bootstrap 吸收—— CI 主要反映 instance-level\n    variability 而非 seed variance，这对 3-seed 设计 是有利的（seed 数少不直接导致 CI 变宽，因为每个 seed 有大量\n    instance）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Main Results with Bootstrap 95% CIs (D062 query-split)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Comparison\n    - Δ (pp)\n    - 95% CI\n    - p-value\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - embed − random\n      - '+1.4'\n      - '[+0.5, +2.3]'\n      - 0.012\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow − random\n      - '+0.7'\n      - '[−0.2, +1.6]'\n      - 0.089\n    - - Qwen\n      - BM25 − random\n      - −2.9\n      - '[−4.1, −1.7]'\n      - 0.001\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embed − random\n      - '+0.9'\n      - '[+0.1, +1.7]'\n      - 0.038\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow − random\n      - −0.5\n      - '[−1.4, +0.4]'\n      - 0.21\n    - - StarCoder\n      - BM25 − random\n      - −2.5\n      - '[−3.8, −1.2]'\n      - 0.003\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Forest plot showing pairwise deltas with 95% CIs for all comparisons'\n  - 'Fig 4b: Bootstrap distribution histograms for embed−random (both encoders)'\n  analysis: 'CI 下界 > 0 for embed, 上界 < 0 for BM25, dataflow borderline——这是理想的 statistical\n    picture for the best tier。Three-tier significance pattern  (BM25 harm ✓, embed\n    help ✓, dataflow conditional ?) 完美映射到三条 claims。\n\n    '\n- name: BM25 Negative Baseline — Closing CoCoHaNeRe Argument\n  plan_id: plan_018\n  description: 'BM25-based hard negatives 作为第 4 策略。Phase 1 (CPU) DONE：BM25 index built，\n    training data mined（11K+ records/seed, k=50）。Phase 2 (GPU)：train 3 seeds ×  2\n    encoders。验证 CoCoHaNeRe 报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\" 是 BM25-proxy artifact。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      bm25_s42_R1: 0.535\n      bm25_s43_R1: 0.538\n      bm25_s44_R1: 0.541\n      bm25_mean_R1: 0.538\n      random_mean_R1: 0.57\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -3.2\n      embed_mean_R1: 0.573\n      embed_minus_bm25_pp: 3.5\n    starcoder:\n      bm25_s42_R1: 0.452\n      bm25_s43_R1: 0.462\n      bm25_s44_R1: 0.458\n      bm25_mean_R1: 0.457\n      random_mean_R1: 0.479\n      bm25_minus_random_pp: -2.2\n      embed_mean_R1: 0.485\n      embed_minus_bm25_pp: 2.8\n    bm25_harms_both_encoders: true\n    cocohanere_artifact_confirmed: true\n    bm25_minus_random_avg_pp: -2.7\n    bm25_overlap_context:\n      bm25_vs_embedding_top7_jaccard_large_repos: 0.297\n      bm25_vs_random_top7_jaccard_large_repos: 0.007\n  result_rationale: 'BM25 negatives 在两个 encoder 上均 harm（Qwen -3.2pp, StarCoder -2.2pp），\n    mean -2.7pp 位于 best 档 [-3.0, -1.0] 范围内。\n\n    BM25 选取的是 lexically similar 但 semantically ambiguous 的文件——共享大量  token overlap（函数名、变量名、import\n    patterns），但这种 overlap 恰恰是 contrastive  learning 用来区分 positive/negative 的信号。用 BM25\n    选的 negatives 使模型学会  ignore lexical cues，但这些 cues 在 code retrieval 中是有效信号。\n\n    Overlap 分析（phase 1 已完成）支持这一解释：大 repo 上 BM25 与 embedding  top-7 Jaccard 仅 0.297——两种\n    mining 选取的 negatives 差异很大。BM25 与 random  仅 0.007——说明 BM25 negatives 与 random sampling\n    几乎无交集（高度 targeted）， 但 targeted 到了错误方向。\n\n    这直接回应 CoCoHaNeRe (ACM TOSEM 2025)：他们报告的 \"embedding negatives harm\"  实际是 BM25-proxy\n    artifact。True embedding distance negatives 方向相反（+0.6~1.4pp）。 BM25 vs embedding\n    的 3.5pp 差距是论文最大的 single pairwise comparison。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Full 4-Strategy Comparison (Standard Eval, best_by_R@1)'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean R@1 (%)\n    - 95% CI\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - BM25\n      - 53.8\n      - '[52.9, 54.7]'\n      - −3.2\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 57.0\n      - '[55.5, 58.5]'\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 55.9\n      - '[55.3, 56.5]'\n      - −1.1\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 57.3\n      - '[56.5, 58.1]'\n      - '+0.3'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - BM25\n      - 45.7\n      - '[44.8, 46.6]'\n      - −2.2\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 47.9\n      - '[46.0, 49.0]'\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 47.2\n      - '[46.5, 47.9]'\n      - −0.7\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 48.5\n      - '[47.2, 50.1]'\n      - '+0.6'\n  - name: 'Table 2b: 4-Strategy on D062 Query-Split Eval'\n    columns:\n    - Encoder\n    - Strategy\n    - Mean R@1 (%)\n    - Δ vs Random (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - Qwen\n      - BM25\n      - 33.2\n      - −2.9\n    - - Qwen\n      - random\n      - 36.1\n      - —\n    - - Qwen\n      - dataflow\n      - 36.8\n      - '+0.7'\n    - - Qwen\n      - embedding\n      - 37.5\n      - '+1.4'\n    - - StarCoder\n      - BM25\n      - 28.0\n      - −2.5\n    - - StarCoder\n      - random\n      - 30.5\n      - —\n    - - StarCoder\n      - dataflow\n      - 30.1\n      - −0.4\n    - - StarCoder\n      - embedding\n      - 31.4\n      - '+0.9'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: 4-strategy R@1 bar chart (D062 eval) with BM25 in red, annotation arrow\n    showing BM25→embed gap'\n  - 'Fig 3b: Neg similarity histograms for 4 strategies showing BM25 occupies distinct\n    region'\n  analysis: 'BM25 baseline 是 best tier 的 crown jewel。将 Claim 1 从 \"argumentative correction\"  升级为\n    \"empirical demonstration\"：不仅指出 CoCoHaNeRe 用了 BM25 proxy，还实际 复现 harm effect 并展示\n    true embedding negatives 方向相反。\n\n    4-strategy ordering BM25 < random < dataflow ≤ embedding 清晰展示 negative  mining\n    的 quality spectrum。注意 standard eval 上 embed Δ 较小（+0.3pp Qwen）， 但 D062 query-split\n    上 embed Δ=+1.4pp——checkpoint selection methodology 揭示 了被 standard eval 掩盖的真实效应。\n\n    '\n- name: Pool Size Sensitivity (50/100/200/500)\n  plan_id: plan_019\n  description: 'SWE-smith validation 上用 pool={50, 100, 200, 500} 重新评估 M2 best checkpoints，\n    测试 strategy ranking 在 realistic pool sizes 下的稳定性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.57\n        embedding_R1: 0.573\n        dataflow_R1: 0.559\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.3\n        note: pool=50 与 standard eval (pool=8) anchor 接近但稍低\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.432\n        embedding_R1: 0.446\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.348\n        embedding_R1: 0.361\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.3\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.265\n        embedding_R1: 0.277\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n    starcoder:\n      pool_50:\n        random_R1: 0.479\n        embedding_R1: 0.485\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 0.6\n      pool_100:\n        random_R1: 0.365\n        embedding_R1: 0.377\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n      pool_200:\n        random_R1: 0.29\n        embedding_R1: 0.301\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.1\n      pool_500:\n        random_R1: 0.222\n        embedding_R1: 0.232\n        embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.0\n    ranking_stable_across_pools: true\n    pool_ranking_stable_pct: 100\n    delta_trend: Δ increases from pool=50 to pool=100, then gradually shrinks at larger\n      pools\n  result_rationale: 'Strategy ranking 在 50→500 全程保持稳定（100% stability）。关键发现：delta 从  pool=50\n    的 0.3-0.6pp 跃升至 pool=100 的 1.2-1.4pp，然后缓慢缩小到 pool=500 的  1.0-1.2pp。\n\n    Pool=50 delta 小是因为标准 eval pool=8 的 ceiling effect 延伸——候选太少， random 已经有较高 baseline。Pool=100\n    时 distractor 数量足够使 mining 质量差异 充分体现（sweet spot）。Pool>200 时 delta 开始缩小因为大 pool\n    中 random negatives  偶然包含 \"hard\" negative 的概率增加（base rate effect），部分弥合了 mining\n    差距。 但核心 signal 不消失——pool=500 仍有 +1.0~1.2pp。\n\n    这直接回应 reviewer \"pool=50 unrealistically small\" concern：即使 10x 扩大， strategy ranking\n    完全不翻转，且 delta 在 realistic pool sizes 反而更大。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Pool Size Sensitivity (R@1 %)'\n    columns:\n    - Pool\n    - Encoder\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - emb−rand (pp)\n    - Ranking\n    rows:\n    - - 50\n      - Qwen\n      - 57.0\n      - 57.3\n      - 55.9\n      - '+0.3'\n      - E≥R>D\n    - - 100\n      - Qwen\n      - 43.2\n      - 44.6\n      - 43.0\n      - '+1.4'\n      - E>R≥D\n    - - 200\n      - Qwen\n      - 34.8\n      - 36.1\n      - 35.0\n      - '+1.3'\n      - E>D>R\n    - - 500\n      - Qwen\n      - 26.5\n      - 27.7\n      - 26.2\n      - '+1.2'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 50\n      - StarCoder\n      - 47.9\n      - 48.5\n      - 47.2\n      - '+0.6'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 100\n      - StarCoder\n      - 36.5\n      - 37.7\n      - 36.2\n      - '+1.2'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 200\n      - StarCoder\n      - 29.0\n      - 30.1\n      - 28.8\n      - '+1.1'\n      - E>R>D\n    - - 500\n      - StarCoder\n      - 22.2\n      - 23.2\n      - 22.0\n      - '+1.0'\n      - E>R≈D\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 9: Pool size (x-axis, log) vs R@1 (y-axis), 3 strategies overlaid, separate\n    panels per encoder'\n  - 'Fig 9b: Delta (embed − random) vs pool size, showing non-monotonic pattern'\n  analysis: 'Pool size sensitivity 是外部有效性关键证据。非单调 pattern（小 pool delta 小 →  medium\n    pool delta 大 → large pool delta 缩小）提供了 mechanistic insight： mining 的价值在 moderate\n    difficulty 区间最大（Goldilocks zone）。 100% ranking stability 在全范围保持是 best tier 标志。\n\n    '\n- name: UniXcoder Multi-Seed Validation (3 seeds × 3 strategies)\n  plan_id: plan_020\n  description: 'UniXcoder-base (encoder-only, 125M) 3 seeds × 3 strategies。 s42 DONE（null\n    result, 0.37pp span）。s43 RUNNING（random done, embed running）。 s44 PREPARING。验证\n    scale boundary condition。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    s42:\n      random_R1: 0.5534\n      embedding_R1: 0.5497\n      dataflow_R1: 0.551\n      span_pp: 0.37\n    s43:\n      random_R1: 0.577\n      embedding_R1: 0.575\n      dataflow_R1: 0.574\n      span_pp: 0.3\n    s44:\n      random_R1: 0.562\n      embedding_R1: 0.56\n      dataflow_R1: 0.561\n      span_pp: 0.2\n    mean_across_seeds:\n      random_R1: 0.564\n      embedding_R1: 0.561\n      dataflow_R1: 0.562\n    overall_span_pp: 0.3\n    max_pairwise_delta_pp: 0.3\n    all_deltas_nonsignificant: true\n    bootstrap_ci_all_contain_zero: true\n    conclusion: 125M encoder-only model saturates regardless of mining strategy\n  result_rationale: 'UniXcoder (125M params, encoder-only architecture) 在所有 3 seeds\n    上均显示  null result——3 策略 R@1 span < 0.4pp，远小于 seed variance (~1.4pp)。\n\n    原因：125M 模型 representation capacity 不足以利用 harder negatives 的信号。 Neg difficulty\n    分析显示 UniXcoder 的 margin 分布已高度压缩（与 Qwen 类似的  high pos_sim），但不同于 Qwen（3B, enough\n    capacity to learn from margin signal）， 125M 模型缺乏参数量来在这个压缩空间中进一步微调区分。\n\n    这干净地归因于 model scale 而非 architecture（UniXcoder 是 encoder-only 但 这不是核心因素——125M 即使是\n    decoder-only 也大概率 saturate）。Paper 中作为  \"effect requires sufficient model capacity\"\n    的 boundary condition，增强故事 的科学严谨性——不是所有模型都能 benefit from mining。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 4: UniXcoder-base (125M) — Scale Boundary Condition'\n    columns:\n    - Seed\n    - random\n    - embedding\n    - dataflow\n    - Span (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 42\n      - 55.34\n      - 54.97\n      - 55.1\n      - 0.37\n    - - 43\n      - 57.7\n      - 57.5\n      - 57.4\n      - 0.3\n    - - 44\n      - 56.2\n      - 56.0\n      - 56.1\n      - 0.2\n    - - Mean\n      - 56.41\n      - 56.16\n      - 56.2\n      - 0.25\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S8: UniXcoder 3-strategy comparison across 3 seeds — flat lines within noise'\n  analysis: '3-seed null result 排除了 \"s42 可能是巧合\" 的 concern。Consistent null across  seeds\n    + significant effect on 3B models = clean scale boundary at ~125M-3B range。 Paper\n    可以明确声明：\"mining strategy effects require models above ~1B parameters  to manifest.\"\n\n    '\n- name: Temperature Ablation Reduced (τ = 0.05, 0.2)\n  plan_id: plan_021\n  description: 'plan_014 的 reduced 版本：τ ∈ {0.05, 0.2} × random+embedding × Qwen ×\n    seed 42。 如果 plan_014 (full, 70h) 无法执行，用 plan_021 (15h) 作为 minimum。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    tau_005:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.56\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.576\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.6\n    tau_020:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.538\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.55\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.2\n    tau_010_reference:\n      qwen_random_R1: 0.553\n      qwen_embedding_R1: 0.567\n      qwen_embedding_minus_random_pp: 1.4\n    ranking_preserved: true\n    regime_specific: false\n  result_rationale: '与 plan_014 相同逻辑，仅覆盖 Qwen + random/embedding。如果 τ=0.05 和 τ=0.2  均显示\n    embedding > random（1.2-1.6pp），且 ranking 不翻转，则 regime-specificity  concern 被关闭。15h\n    GPU budget 是可接受的 minimum viable ablation。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S8: Temperature Ablation (Reduced, Qwen only)'\n    columns:\n    - τ\n    - random R@1 (%)\n    - embedding R@1 (%)\n    - Δ (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - 0.05\n      - 56.0\n      - 57.6\n      - '+1.6'\n    - - 0.1\n      - 55.3\n      - 56.7\n      - '+1.4'\n    - - 0.2\n      - 53.8\n      - 55.0\n      - '+1.2'\n  figures_description: []\n  analysis: 'Reduced ablation 足以回应 reviewer concern。如果 GPU budget 允许， 扩展到 StarCoder\n    + dataflow（plan_014 full）提供更完整覆盖。\n\n    '\n- name: D062 Checkpoint Selection Criterion Effect Analysis\n  plan_id: d062_checkpoint_criterion\n  description: 'D062 创新方法论贡献：从 2980 val queries 分出 500-query selection set（用于  checkpoint\n    selection）+ 2480-query held-out evaluation set。分析 checkpoint  选择标准（best_by_val_loss\n    vs best_by_R@1）对最终性能的影响。\n\n    D065 发现：Qwen random_s43 by_R@1=0.504 vs by_val_loss=0.341（+16.3pp）， s42 两标准同一\n    checkpoint（R@1=0.230）。这一效应远大于 mining strategy effect。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen_query_split:\n      random_s42:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.23\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.23\n        criterion_gap_pp: 0.0\n        note: 两标准选到同一 checkpoint\n      random_s43:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.341\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.504\n        criterion_gap_pp: 16.3\n        note: 最大 criterion effect，val_loss 选 step 500, R@1 选 step 1500\n      random_s44:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.35\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.385\n        criterion_gap_pp: 3.5\n      embed_s42:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.245\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.265\n        criterion_gap_pp: 2.0\n      embed_s43:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.365\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.518\n        criterion_gap_pp: 15.3\n      embed_s44:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.37\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.395\n        criterion_gap_pp: 2.5\n      dataflow_s43:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.355\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.51\n        criterion_gap_pp: 15.5\n    starcoder_query_split:\n      random_s42:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.28\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.31\n        criterion_gap_pp: 3.0\n      random_s43:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.295\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.42\n        criterion_gap_pp: 12.5\n      embed_s42:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.27\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.305\n        criterion_gap_pp: 3.5\n      embed_s43:\n        by_val_loss_R1: 0.3\n        by_recall_at_1_R1: 0.435\n        criterion_gap_pp: 13.5\n    summary_statistics:\n      max_criterion_effect_pp: 16.3\n      mean_criterion_effect_pp: 8.5\n      median_criterion_effect_pp: 3.5\n      criterion_effect_nonzero_rate: 0.72\n      mining_strategy_mean_effect_pp: 1.2\n      criterion_to_mining_ratio: 7.1\n    replicates_across_encoders: true\n    replicates_across_seeds: true\n  result_rationale: 'D062 query-split evaluation 揭示了一个被忽视的方法论问题：标准 contrastive  retrieval\n    评估中，checkpoint 是在 val set 上选择的，然后在 SAME val set 上 报告 R@1——这导致 checkpoint selection\n    过拟合 val queries。\n\n    Query-split 方法将 val queries 分为 selection set (500) 和 evaluation set  (2480)。在\n    held-out evaluation 上，best_by_val_loss 与 best_by_R@1 的差距 高达 16.3pp（Qwen s43），因为：\n\n    (1) val_loss 在 step 500 最低——此时模型刚开始训练，泛化最好但 ranking 能力不足； (2) R@1 在 step 1500\n    最高——此时模型已学会 ranking 但开始 overfit； (3) 在 held-out queries 上，step 1500 的 ranking\n    能力泛化良好（0.504）， 而 step 500 的 ranking 能力不足（0.341）。\n\n    The criterion effect (+16.3pp max, 8.5pp mean) >> mining strategy effect (~1.2pp)，\n    ratio 7:1。这意味着社区对 mining strategy 效果的评估被 checkpoint selection  noise 掩盖。\n\n    StarCoder 上 effect 稍小（max 13.5pp）但方向一致——pattern replicates。\n\n    这是论文独立方法论贡献： - 发现：standard eval 系统性高估所有策略的绝对 R@1（因为 checkpoint overfit） - 发现：standard\n    eval 系统性低估策略间差异（因为 criterion noise 掩盖 signal） - 推荐：use query-split + R@1 criterion\n    for checkpoint selection\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: Checkpoint Criterion Effect (D062 Query-Split, Qwen)'\n    columns:\n    - Strategy\n    - Seed\n    - by val_loss R@1\n    - by R@1 R@1\n    - Gap (pp)\n    rows:\n    - - random\n      - 42\n      - 0.23\n      - 0.23\n      - '0.0'\n    - - random\n      - 43\n      - 0.341\n      - 0.504\n      - '+16.3'\n    - - random\n      - 44\n      - 0.35\n      - 0.385\n      - '+3.5'\n    - - embedding\n      - 42\n      - 0.245\n      - 0.265\n      - '+2.0'\n    - - embedding\n      - 43\n      - 0.365\n      - 0.518\n      - '+15.3'\n    - - embedding\n      - 44\n      - 0.37\n      - 0.395\n      - '+2.5'\n    - - dataflow\n      - 43\n      - 0.355\n      - 0.51\n      - '+15.5'\n  - name: 'Table 9b: Criterion Effect Summary'\n    columns:\n    - Statistic\n    - Value\n    rows:\n    - - Max criterion effect\n      - +16.3pp\n    - - Mean criterion effect\n      - +8.5pp\n    - - Mean mining strategy effect\n      - +1.2pp\n    - - Criterion-to-mining ratio\n      - 7.1×\n    - - Runs with >5pp criterion effect\n      - 3/14 (21%)\n    - - Replicates across encoders\n      - 'Yes'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: Criterion effect scatter plot — each point is one run, x=by_val_loss R@1,\n    y=by_R@1 R@1, diagonal line shows equality'\n  - 'Fig 2b: Training trajectory for s43 showing val_loss/R@1 divergence annotated\n    with criterion effect'\n  analysis: 'Checkpoint criterion effect 是 D062 论文最意外也最有影响力的发现。\n\n    +16.3pp >> +1.2pp (mining) 意味着： (1) 论文不仅展示 \"mining helps\" 还展示 \"how to properly\n    evaluate whether mining helps\" (2) 解释了为什么文献中 mining strategy delta 通常很小——standard\n    eval 掩盖了 signal (3) 提供了 evaluation protocol 改进建议，对整个 contrastive retrieval 社区有价值\n\n    s43 的 16.3pp 出现在 val_loss 和 R@1 最严重分歧时——val_loss 选择了训练最早期 的 checkpoint（泛化好但 ranking\n    弱），R@1 选择了训练中期的 checkpoint（ranking  最优但即将 overfit）。只有 query-split 方法才能在 held-out\n    上正确评判这一差异。\n\n    这一发现使论文从 \"mining strategy comparison\" 升级为 \"evaluation methodology +  mining strategy\n    comparison\"——双重贡献，EMNLP Main 更强。'\n","numLines":1518,"startLine":1,"totalLines":1518}}}
